 de testes automatizados","padrões de teste .NET","desenvolvimento de software","testes de unidade","código C#","automatização de testes"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для тестирования","юнит-тесты C#","инструмент тестирования .NET","генерация автоматических тестов","рекомендации по тестированию .NET","разработка программного обеспечения","юнит-тестирование","код C#","автоматизация тестирования"],"ar":["عميل الذكاء الاصطناعي للاختبار","اختبارات وحدة C#","أداة اختبار .NET","توليد اختبارات tự động","معايير الاختبار .NET","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات الوحدة","код C#","تأتمتة الاختبار"]}},"owner":"klemensms","repo":"mcp-consultant-tools","repoPath":"klemensms/mcp-consultant-tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.359Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"write-unit-tests","description":"Generate comprehensive unit tests for .NET/C# code following project-specific testing patterns and standards. Supports NUnit with FakeItEasy (Domain/Infrastructure) and FakeXrmEasy (Dataverse plugins). Use when asked to write unit tests, generate tests, create test coverage, test C# classes/methods, or add test files for .NET projects. Covers all scenarios including happy path, validation, business logic, error handling, and integration tests.","bodyPreview":"version: \"1.0\"\nauthor: Michal Sobieraj \n\n# Unit Test Generation Prompt\n\n## Role\nYou are an expert .NET testing specialist. Analyze C# source code files and generate comprehensive unit tests following the testing patterns and standards defined in the project''s testing instructions.\n\n## Task\nGenerate complete unit test files that cover all business scenarios, edge cases, and error conditions for the given source code.\n\n## Additional instructions\nWhen extending or tweaking existing unit tests, use","body":"version: \"1.0\"\nauthor: Michal Sobieraj \n\n# Unit Test Generation Prompt\n\n## Role\nYou are an expert .NET testing specialist. Analyze C# source code files and generate comprehensive unit tests following the testing patterns and standards defined in the project''s testing instructions.\n\n## Task\nGenerate complete unit test files that cover all business scenarios, edge cases, and error conditions for the given source code.\n\n## Additional instructions\nWhen extending or tweaking existing unit tests, use this SKILL.md document and follow the existing conventions in the file.\n\nWhen creating new unit tests for a new class or project:\n**YOU MUST first read the file `.claude/skills/write-unit-tests/write-unit-tests-instructions.md` before proceeding.** This file contains comprehensive testing patterns, AAA structure examples, assertion patterns, and framework-specific configurations that are essential for generating proper unit tests.\n\n\n## Analysis Requirements\n\n### 1. Project Type Identification\nDetermine the project type to apply correct testing patterns:\n- **Domain (.NET 8.0)**: Business logic, services, validators → NUnit + FakeItEasy\n- **Infrastructure (.NET 8.0)**: Dataverse repositories → NUnit + FakeXrmEasy (Commercial)\n- **Plugin (.NET 4.8)**: Dataverse plugins → NUnit + FakeXrmEasy (NonCommercial)\n\n### 2. Test Scenario Coverage\nFor each public method, generate tests for:\n- **Happy Path**: Valid inputs, successful operations\n- **Input Validation**: Null checks, empty values, invalid formats, boundary conditions\n- **Business Logic**: Domain rules, calculations, state transitions, conditional branches\n- **Error Handling**: Exceptions, error results, failure recovery\n- **Dependencies**: Mock behavior, call verification, failure scenarios\n- **Integration**: External services, database operations (mark with `[Category(\"Integration\")]`)\n\n## Critical Requirements\n\n### Must Follow Testing Instructions\n- **AAA Pattern**: Strict Arrange-Act-Assert structure with clear section separation\n- **NUnit Constraint Model**: Use `Assert.That()` - NEVER classic Assert methods\n- **Naming**: `MethodName_Scenario_ExpectedResult` pattern\n- **Framework Versions**: Use exact versions specified in testing instructions\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n### 1. Complete Test File\n- Full test class with proper namespace and using statements\n- All required NuGet packages listed in comments\n- Proper test lifecycle setup (`[SetUp]`, `[OneTimeSetUp]`)\n- Helper methods for test data creation\n\n### 2. Test Coverage Summary\n- Number of test methods generated\n- Scenarios covered per method\n- Dependencies mocked\n- Special considerations\n\n### 3. Setup Instructions\n- Required NuGet packages for the test project\n- Any additional configuration needed\n- Integration test requirements\n\n## Process\n1. **Analyze** source code structure and identify project type\n2. **Extract** all testable methods and business logic\n3. **Generate** comprehensive test methods using established patterns\n4. **Verify** all scenarios are covered with proper assertions\n5. **Provide** complete, maintainable test file\n\nGenerate tests that follow the project''s testing standards and would pass senior developer review."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:10.297Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for C#-focused AI Agents needing automated unit test generation for .NET projects.","zh":"适用于需要为 .NET 项目生成自动化单元测试的 C#-focused AI Agents 的理想选择。","ja":"C# に焦点を当てた AI エージェントが .NET プロジェクトの自動ユニットテスト生成を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"C#-focused AI 에이전트가 .NET 프로젝트를 위한 자동 유닛 테스트 생성이 필요한 경우 최적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en C# que necesitan generación automática de pruebas unitarias para proyectos .NET.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur C# nécessitant une génération automatisée de tests unitaires pour les projets .NET.","de":"Ideal für C#-fokussierte KI-Agenten, die eine automatisierte Generierung von Einheitstests für .NET-Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em C# que necessitam de geração automática de testes unitários para projetos .NET.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на C#, требующих автоматического генерирования модульных тестов для проектов .NET.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي ذي التركيز على C# الذي يحتاج إلى توليد اختبارات الوحدة التلقائي لمشاريع .NET."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive unit tests covering business scenarios, edge cases, and error conditions, utilizing C# source code analysis and adhering to project-defined testing patterns and standards.","zh":"赋予代理生成全面单元测试的能力，涵盖业务场景、边缘情况和错误条件，利用 C# 源代码分析，并遵循项目定义的测试模式和标准。","ja":"ビジネス シナリオ、エッジ ケース、エラー条件を網羅する包括的なユニット テストを生成するエージェントをEmpowerします。C# ソース コード分析を利用し、プロジェクトで定義されたテスト パターンと標準に従います。","ko":"비즈니스 시나리오, 에지 케이스, 오류 조건을 포함하는 포괄적인 유닛 테스트를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 Empower합니다. C# 소스 코드 분석을 활용하고 프로젝트에서 정의한 테스트 패턴 및 표준을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar pruebas unitarias integrales que cubren escenarios comerciales, casos límite y condiciones de error, utilizando el análisis de código fuente C# y ajustándose a los patrones y estándares de prueba definidos por el proyecto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des tests unitaires complets couvrant les scénarios métier, les cas limites et les conditions d''erreur, en utilisant l''analyse du code source C# et en respectant les modèles et les normes de test définis par le projet.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Einheitstests zu generieren, die Geschäftsszenarien, Randfälle und Fehlerbedingungen abdecken, indem sie die C#-Quellcodeanalyse nutzen und sich an die vom Projekt definierten Testmuster und -standards halten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerarem testes unitários abrangentes que cubram cenários de negócios, casos de bordo e condições de erro, utilizando análise de código-fonte C# e aderindo a padrões e normas de teste definidos pelo projeto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать всесторонние модульные тесты, покрывающие бизнес-сценарии, граничные случаи и условия ошибок, используя анализ исходного кода C# и соблюдая проектно-определенные шаблоны и стандарты тестирования.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد اختبارات وحدة شاملة تغطي سيناريوهات الأعمال والحالات الحدودية ووضعيات الأخطاء، باستخدام تحليل شفرة المصدر C# والامتثال لمعايير ونمطيات الاختبار المحددة في المشروع."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating unit tests for .NET applications","Automating test coverage for C# source code","Validating error conditions and edge cases in .NET projects"],"zh":["为 .NET 应用程序生成单元测试","自动化 C# 源代码的测试覆盖","验证 .NET 项目中的错误条件和边缘情况"],"ja":[".NET アプリケーションのユニット テストを生成する","C# ソース コードのテスト カバレッジを自動化する",".NET プロジェクトのエラー条件とエッジ ケースを検証する"],"ko":[".NET 애플리케이션을 위한 유닛 테스트 생성","C# 소스 코드의 테스트 커버리지를 자동화",".NET 프로젝트의 오류 조건 및 에지 케이스를 검증"],"es":["Generación de pruebas unitarias para aplicaciones .NET","Automatización de la cobertura de pruebas para el código fuente C#","Validación de condiciones de error y casos límite en proyectos .NET"],"fr":["Génération de tests unitaires pour les applications .NET","Automatisation de la couverture de tests pour le code source C#","Validation des conditions d''erreur et des cas limites dans les projets .NET"],"de":["Generierung von Einheitstests für .NET-Anwendungen","Automatisierung der Testabdeckung für C#-Quellcode","Validierung von Fehlerbedingungen und Randfällen in .NET-Projekten"],"pt":["Geração de testes unitários para aplicações .NET","Automatização da cobertura de testes para código-fonte C#","Validação de condições de erro e casos de bordo em projetos .NET"],"ru":["Генерирование модульных тестов для приложений .NET","Автоматизация тестового покрытия для исходного кода C#","Проверка условий ошибок и граничных случаев в проектах .NET"],"ar":["توليد اختبارات الوحدة لبرامج .NET","أتمتة تغطية الاختبار للكود المصدري C#","تحقق من حالات الخطأ والحالات الحدودية في مشاريع .NET"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires C# source code files",".NET testing specialists'' input for testing instructions","Version 1.0 compatibility"],"zh":["需要 C# 源代码文件","需要 .NET 测试专家的输入以获取测试说明","版本 1.0 兼容性"],"ja":["C# ソース コード ファイルが必要",".NET テスト専門家の入力がテスト指示を取得するために必要","バージョン 1.0 との互換性"],"ko":["C# 소스 코드 파일이 필요",".NET 테스트 전문가의 입력이 테스트 지침을 얻기 위해 필요","버전 1.0 호환성"],"es":["Requiere archivos de código fuente C#","Entrada de especialistas en pruebas .NET para instrucciones de prueba","Compatibilidad con la versión 1.0"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers de code source C#","Contribution des spécialistes en tests .NET pour les instructions de test","Compatibilité avec la version 1.0"],"de":["Benötigt C#-Quellcode-Dateien","Eingabe von .NET-Testspezialisten für Testanweisungen","Kompatibilität mit Version 1.0"],"pt":["Requer arquivos de código-fonte C#","Entrada de especialistas em teste .NET para instruções de teste","Compatibilidade com a versão 1.0"],"ru":["Требует файлов исходного кода C#","Ввод специальностей тестирования .NET для инструкций по тестированию","Совместимость с версией 1.0"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات شفرة المصدر C#","مدخلات أخصائيي اختبار .NET لتعليمات الاختبار","التوافق مع الإصدار 1.0"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"dedbe05130882cc09d1c87fe167faef91d470da97d1c19dca496873cd4791117","qualityScore":44}');
