コシステムを最適化するためのルールとガイドラインのこと","ko":"React Three Fiber 최적화는 React Three Fiber와 Poimandres 생태계를 최적화하는 규칙과 가이드라인입니다","es":"Un conjunto de reglas y guías para optimizar el rendimiento y la integración de React Three Fiber con la ecología de Poimandres","fr":"Un ensemble de règles et de guides pour optimiser les performances et l''intégration de React Three Fiber avec l''écosystème Poimandres","de":"Eine Sammlung von Regeln und Anleitungen zur Optimierung der Leistung und Integration von React Three Fiber mit der Poimandres-Ökologie","pt":"O r3f-best-practices é um conjunto de diretrizes para otimizar o desempenho do React Three Fiber","ru":"r3f-best-practices - это набор руководств для оптимизации производительности React Three Fiber","ar":"r3f-best-practices هو مجموعة من الإرشادات لتحسين أداء React Three Fiber"},"features":{"en":["Provides 60+ rules across 11 categories for optimized React Three Fiber performance","Covers best practices for writing new R3F components","Includes guidelines for using Drei helpers correctly","Offers tips for managing state with Zustand","Supports implementation of post-processing or physics in R3F","Covers the @react-three/fiber and @r ecosystems"],"zh":["包含 60+ 条规则，优化 React Three Fiber 性能","涵盖 @react-three/fiber 和 @r 库","提供 Zustand 和 Drei helpers 的最佳实践","支持 post-processing 和 physics 的实现"],"ja":["60以上のルールを含み、React Three Fiber のパフォーマンスを最適化","@react-three/fiber と @r ライブラリをカバー","Zustand と Drei helpers のベストプラクティスを提供","ポストプロセッシングと物理の実装をサポート"],"ko":["60개 이상의 규칙을 포함하여 React Three Fiber 성능을 최적화","@react-three/fiber와 @r 라이브러리를 포함","Zustand와 Drei helpers의 최적화된 가이드를 제공","포스트 프로세싱과 물리 구현을 지원"],"es":["Optimización de rendimiento de React Three Fiber","Guías para una integración perfecta con la ecología de Poimandres","Uso correcto de Drei helpers","Gestión de estado con Zustand","Implementación de post-procesamiento y física"],"fr":["Optimisation des performances de React Three Fiber","Guides pour une intégration parfaite avec l''écosystème Poimandres","Utilisation correcte des helpers Drei","Gestion de l''état avec Zustand","Implémentation du post-traitement et de la physique"],"de":["Leistungsoptimierung von React Three Fiber","Anleitungen für eine perfekte Integration mit der Poimandres-Ökologie","Korrekte Verwendung von Drei-Hilfen","Zustandsverwaltung mit Zustand","Implementierung von Postverarbeitung und Physik"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho com 60+ regras em 11 categorias","Uso correto de helpers Drei","Gestão de estado com Zustand","Implementação de pós-processamento e física","Integração com @react-three/fiber e @r"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности с 60+ правилами в 11 категориях","Правильное использование хелперов Drei","Управление состоянием с Zustand","Реализация пост-процессинга и физики","Интеграция с @react-three/fiber и @r"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء مع 60+ قاعدة في 11 فئة","استخدام सहيح لمساعدي Drei","إدارة الحالة مع Zustand","تنفيذ المعالجة التالية والفيزياء","التكامل مع @react-three/fiber و @r"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use r3f-best-practices","what is r3f-best-practices","r3f-best-practices alternative","r3f-best-practices vs react-three","r3f-best-practices install","r3f-best-practices setup guide","react three fiber optimization","zustand state management","drei helpers tutorial"],"zh":["React Three Fiber","Poimandres","最佳实践","性能优化","渲染优化","Zustand","Drei helpers","post-processing","physics"],"ja":["React Three Fiber","Poimandres","ベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化","レンダリング最適化","Zustand","Drei helpers","ポストプロセッシング","物理"],"ko":["React Three Fiber","Poimandres","최적화 가이드","성능 최적화","렌더링 최적화","Zustand","Drei helpers","포스트 프로세싱","물리"],"es":["React Three Fiber","Poimandres","optimización de rendimiento","integración de ecología","Drei helpers","Zustand","post-procesamiento","física","mejores prácticas"],"fr":["React Three Fiber","Poimandres","optimisation des performances","intégration de l''écosystème","helpers Drei","Zustand","post-traitement","physique","meilleures pratiques"],"de":["React Three Fiber","Poimandres","Leistungsoptimierung","Integration der Ökologie","Drei-Hilfen","Zustand","Postverarbeitung","Physik","Best Practices"],"pt":["r3f-best-practices","React Three Fiber","otimização de desempenho","Drei helpers","Zustand","pós-processamento","física","desenvolvimento de jogos","realidade virtual"],"ru":["r3f-best-practices","React Three Fiber","оптимизация производительности","Drei хелперы","Zustand","пост-процессинг","физика","разработка игр","виртуальная реальность"],"ar":["r3f-best-practices","React Three Fiber","تحسين الأداء","مساعدي Drei","Zustand","المعالجة التالية","الفيزياء","تطوير الألعاب","الواقع الافتراضي"]}},"owner":"deadronos","repo":"copilot-chat-playground","repoPath":"deadronos/copilot-chat-playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.386Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"r3f-best-practices","description":"React Three Fiber (R3F) and Poimandres ecosystem best practices. Use when writing, reviewing, or optimizing R3F code. Triggers on tasks involving @react-three/fiber, @react-three/drei, zustand, @react-three/postprocessing, @react-three/rapier, or leva.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# React Three Fiber Best Practices\n\nComprehensive guide for React Three Fiber and the Poimandres ecosystem. Contains 60+ rules across 11 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new R3F components\n- Optimizing R3F performance (re-renders are the #1 issue)\n- Using Drei helpers correctly\n- Managing state with Zustand\n- Implementing post-processing or physics\n\n## Ecosystem Coverage\n\n- **@react-three/fiber** - React renderer for Three.js\n- **@r","body":"# React Three Fiber Best Practices\n\nComprehensive guide for React Three Fiber and the Poimandres ecosystem. Contains 60+ rules across 11 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new R3F components\n- Optimizing R3F performance (re-renders are the #1 issue)\n- Using Drei helpers correctly\n- Managing state with Zustand\n- Implementing post-processing or physics\n\n## Ecosystem Coverage\n\n- **@react-three/fiber** - React renderer for Three.js\n- **@react-three/drei** - Useful helpers and abstractions\n- **@react-three/postprocessing** - Post-processing effects\n- **@react-three/rapier** - Physics engine\n- **zustand** - State management\n- **leva** - Debug GUI\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Performance & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `perf-` |\n| 2 | useFrame & Animation | CRITICAL | `frame-` |\n| 3 | Component Patterns | HIGH | `component-` |\n| 4 | Canvas & Setup | HIGH | `canvas-` |\n| 5 | Drei Helpers | MEDIUM-HIGH | `drei-` |\n| 6 | Loading & Suspense | MEDIUM-HIGH | `loading-` |\n| 7 | State Management | MEDIUM | `state-` |\n| 8 | Events & Interaction | MEDIUM | `events-` |\n| 9 | Post-processing | MEDIUM | `postpro-` |\n| 10 | Physics (Rapier) | LOW-MEDIUM | `physics-` |\n| 11 | Leva (Debug GUI) | LOW | `leva-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Performance & Re-renders (CRITICAL)\n\n- `perf-never-set-state-in-useframe` - NEVER call setState in useFrame\n- `perf-isolate-state` - Isolate components that need React state\n- `perf-zustand-selectors` - Use Zustand selectors, not entire store\n- `perf-transient-subscriptions` - Use transient subscriptions for continuous values\n- `perf-memo-components` - Memoize expensive components\n- `perf-keys-for-lists` - Use stable keys for dynamic lists\n- `perf-avoid-inline-objects` - Avoid creating objects/arrays in JSX\n- `perf-dispose-auto` - Understand R3F auto-dispose behavior\n\n### 2. useFrame & Animation (CRITICAL)\n\n- `frame-priority` - Use priority for execution order\n- `frame-delta-time` - Always use delta for animations\n- `frame-conditional-subscription` - Disable useFrame when not needed\n- `frame-destructure-state` - Destructure only what you need\n- `frame-render-on-demand` - Use invalidate() for on-demand rendering\n- `frame-avoid-heavy-computation` - Move heavy work outside useFrame\n\n### 3. Component Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- `component-jsx-elements` - Use JSX for Three.js objects\n- `component-attach-prop` - Use attach for non-standard properties\n- `component-primitive` - Use primitive for existing objects\n- `component-extend` - Use extend() for custom classes\n- `component-forwardref` - Use forwardRef for reusable components\n- `component-dispose-null` - Set dispose={null} on shared resources\n\n### 4. Canvas & Setup (HIGH)\n\n- `canvas-size-container` - Canvas fills parent container\n- `canvas-camera-default` - Configure camera via prop\n- `canvas-gl-config` - Configure WebGL context\n- `canvas-shadows` - Enable shadows at Canvas level\n- `canvas-frameloop` - Choose appropriate frameloop mode\n- `canvas-events` - Configure event handling\n- `canvas-linear-flat` - Use linear/flat for correct colors\n\n### 5. Drei Helpers (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `drei-use-gltf` - useGLTF with preloading\n- `drei-use-texture` - useTexture for texture loading\n- `drei-environment` - Environment for realistic lighting\n- `drei-orbit-controls` - OrbitControls from Drei\n- `drei-html` - Html for DOM overlays\n- `drei-text` - Text for 3D text\n- `drei-instances` - Instances for optimized instancing\n- `drei-use-helper` - useHelper for debug visualization\n- `drei-bounds` - Bounds to fit camera\n- `drei-center` - Center to center objects\n- `drei-float` - Float for floating animation\n\n### 6. Loading & Suspense (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `loading-suspense` - Wrap async components in Suspense\n- `loading-preload` - Preload assets with useGLTF.preload\n- `loading-use-progress` - useProgress for loading UI\n- `loading-lazy-components` - Lazy load heavy components\n- `loading-error-boundary` - Handle loading errors\n\n### 7. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `state-zustand-store` - Create focused Zustand stores\n- `state-avoid-objects-in-store` - Be careful with Three.js objects\n- `state-subscribeWithSelector` - Fine-grained subscriptions\n- `state-persist` - Persist state when needed\n- `state-separate-concerns` - Separate stores by concern\n\n### 8. Events & Interaction (MEDIUM)\n\n- `events-pointer-events` - Use pointer events on meshes\n- `events-stop-propagation` - Prevent event bubbling\n- `events-cursor-pointer` - Change cursor on hover\n- `events-raycast-filter` - Filter raycasting\n- `events-event-data` - Understand event data structure\n\n### 9. Post-processing (MEDIUM)\n\n- `postpro-effect-composer` - Use EffectComposer\n- `postpro-common-effects` - Common effects reference\n- `postpro-selective-bloom` - SelectiveBloom for optimized glow\n- `postpro-custom-shader` - Create custom effects\n- `postpro-performance` - Optimize post-processing\n\n### 10. Physics Rapier (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `physics-setup` - Basic Rapier setup\n- `physics-body-types` - dynamic, fixed, kinematic\n- `physics-colliders` - Choose appropriate colliders\n- `physics-events` - Handle collision events\n- `physics-api-ref` - Use ref for physics API\n- `physics-performance` - Optimize physics\n\n### 11. Leva (LOW)\n\n- `leva-basic` - Basic Leva usage\n- `leva-folders` - Organize with folders\n- `leva-conditional` - Hide in production\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/perf-never-set-state-in-useframe.md\nrules/drei-use-gltf.md\nrules/state-zustand-selectors.md\n```\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `../R3F_BEST_PRACTICES.md`\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n### NEVER setState in useFrame\n\n```jsx\n// BAD - 60 re-renders per second!\nfunction BadComponent() {\n  const [position, setPosition] = useState(0);\n  useFrame(() => {\n    setPosition(p => p + 0.01); // NEVER DO THIS\n  });\n  return <mesh position-x={position} />;\n}\n\n// GOOD - Mutate refs directly\nfunction GoodComponent() {\n  const meshRef = useRef();\n  useFrame(() => {\n    meshRef.current.position.x += 0.01;\n  });\n  return <mesh ref={meshRef} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Zustand Selectors\n\n```jsx\n// BAD - Re-renders on ANY store change\nconst store = useGameStore();\n\n// GOOD - Only re-renders when playerX changes\nconst playerX = useGameStore(state => state.playerX);\n\n// BETTER - No re-renders, direct mutation\nuseFrame(() => {\n  const { value } = useStore.getState();\n  ref.current.position.x = value;\n});\n```\n\n### Drei useGLTF\n\n```jsx\nimport { useGLTF } from ''@react-three/drei'';\n\nfunction Model() {\n  const { scene } = useGLTF(''/model.glb'');\n  return <primitive object={scene} />;\n}\n\n// Preload for instant loading\nuseGLTF.preload(''/model.glb'');\n```\n\n### Suspense Loading\n\n```jsx\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <Suspense fallback={<Loader />}>\n        <Model />\n      </Suspense>\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:05:51.824Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React Three Fiber performance and best practices for 3D rendering in the browser.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React Three Fiber 性能和在浏览器中进行 3D 渲染的最佳实践的前端代理。","ja":"React Three Fiber のパフォーマンスを最適化し、ブラウザでの 3D レンダリングのベストプラクティスが必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React Three Fiber 성능을 최적화하고 브라우저에서 3D 렌더링에 대한 모범 사례가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan un rendimiento optimizado de React Three Fiber y las mejores prácticas para renderizado 3D en el navegador.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des performances optimisées de React Three Fiber et les meilleures pratiques pour le rendu 3D dans le navigateur.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes React Three Fiber-Performance und Best Practices für 3D-Rendering im Browser benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desempenho otimizado do React Three Fiber e das melhores práticas para renderização 3D no navegador.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим оптимизированный React Three Fiber и лучшие практики для трехмерного рендеринга в браузере.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء محسّن من React Three Fiber وأفضل الممارسات للتصيير ثلاثي الأبعاد في المتصفح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Three Fiber components using 60+ rules across 11 categories, covering critical aspects like re-renders, Drei helpers, and Zustand state management, ensuring efficient and high-performance 3D visualizations with @react-three/fiber and the Poimandres ecosystem.","zh":"赋予代理优化 React Three Fiber 组件的能力，使用 60 多条规则跨 11 个类别，涵盖重新渲染、Drei 辅助函数和 Zustand 状态管理等关键方面，确保使用 @react-three/fiber 和 Poimandres 生态系统进行高效和高性能的 3D 可视化。","ja":"エージェントに React Three Fiber コンポーネントを最適化する能力を与え、60 を超えるルールを 11 のカテゴリにわたって使用し、再レンダリング、Drei ヘルパー、Zustand 状態管理などの重要な側面をカバーし、@react-three/fiber と Poimandres エコシステムを使用した効率的で高パフォーマンスな 3D 可視化を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 React Three Fiber 컴포넌트를 최적화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 11개의 카테고리를跨越한 60개 이상의 규칙을 사용하여, 재 렌더링, Drei 헬퍼, Zustand 상태 관리와 같은 중요한 측면을 다루고, @react-three/fiber와 Poimandres 생태계를 사용한 효율적이고 고성능의 3D 시각화를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar los componentes de React Three Fiber utilizando más de 60 reglas en 11 categorías, cubriendo aspectos críticos como re-renders, ayudantes Drei y gestión de estado Zustand, garantizando visualizaciones 3D eficientes y de alto rendimiento con @react-three/fiber y el ecosistema Poimandres.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les composants React Three Fiber en utilisant plus de 60 règles dans 11 catégories, couvrant des aspects critiques tels que les re-renders, les aides Drei et la gestion d''état Zustand, garantissant des visualisations 3D efficaces et hautes performances avec @react-three/fiber et l''écosystème Poimandres.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, React Three Fiber-Komponenten mithilfe von über 60 Regeln in 11 Kategorien zu optimieren, wodurch kritische Aspekte wie Re-Renderings, Drei-Hilfen und Zustand-Verwaltung abgedeckt werden, um effiziente und hochleistungsfähige 3D-Visualisierungen mit @react-three/fiber und dem Poimandres-Ökosystem sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar componentes do React Three Fiber usando mais de 60 regras em 11 categorias, abrangendo aspectos críticos como re-renders, ajudantes Drei e gerenciamento de estado Zustand, garantindo visualizações 3D eficientes e de alto desempenho com @react-three/fiber e o ecossistema Poimandres.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать компоненты React Three Fiber, используя более 60 правил в 11 категориях, охватывающих критические аспекты, такие как повторное рендеринг, помощники Drei и управление состоянием Zustand, обеспечивая эффективные и высокопроизводительные трехмерные визуализации с @react-three/fiber и экосистемой Poimandres.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين مكونات React Three Fiber باستخدام أكثر من 60 قاعدة في 11 فئة، وتغطية الجوانب الحرجة مثل إعادة التصيير، ومساعدي Drei، وإدارة حالة Zustand، مما يضمن تصورات 3D فعالة وأداء عالي مع @react-three/fiber وبيئة Poimandres."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing R3F component re-renders for smoother performance","Implementing post-processing effects with precision","Debugging and refining physics integrations in 3D scenes"],"zh":["优化 R3F 组件的重新渲染以获得更平滑的性能","使用精确度实现后处理效果","调试和完善 3D 场景中的物理集成"],"ja":["R3F コンポーネントの再レンダリングを最適化してスムーズなパフォーマンスを実現する","精度を使用してポストプロセッシング効果を実装する","3D シーン内の物理的統合をデバッグして改善する"],"ko":["R3F 컴포넌트의 재 렌더링을 최적화하여 더 매끄러운 성능을 얻는 것","정밀도 사용하여 후 처리 효과를 구현하는 것","3D 장면 내 물리적 통합을 디버깅하고 개선하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar los re-renders de los componentes R3F para un rendimiento más suave","Implementar efectos de post-procesamiento con precisión","Depurar y perfeccionar las integraciones de física en escenas 3D"],"fr":["Optimiser les re-renders des composants R3F pour des performances plus fluides","Mettre en œuvre des effets de post-traitement avec précision","Déboguer et affiner les intégrations de physique dans les scènes 3D"],"de":["Optimieren des R3F-Komponenten-Re-Renderings für ein reibungsloseres Performance","Präzise Implementierung von Post-Bearbeitungseffekten","Fehlerbehebung und Verfeinerung der Physik-Integrationen in 3D-Szenen"],"pt":["Otimizar re-renders de componentes R3F para um desempenho mais suave","Implementar efeitos de pós-processamento com precisão","Depurar e aperfeiçoar integrações de física em cenas 3D"],"ru":["Оптимизировать повторное рендеринг компонентов R3F для более плавной производительности","Реализовать эффекты постобработки с точностью","Отлаживать и совершенствовать интеграции физики в трехмерных сценах"],"ar":["تحسين إعادة تصيير مكونات R3F لتحقيق أداء أكثر سلاسة","تطبيق تأثيرات ما بعد المعالجة بدقة","تصحيح الأخطاء وتحسين التكاملات الفيزيائية في المشاهد ثلاثية الأبعاد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Three.js","Specific to @react-three/fiber and Poimandres ecosystem"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Three.js","特定于 @react-three/fiber 和 Poimandres 生态系统"],"ja":["React と Three.js の知識が必要","@react-three/fiber と Poimandres エコシステムに特化している"],"ko":["React와 Three.js에 대한 지식이 필요","@react-three/fiber와 Poimandres 생태계에 특화"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Three.js","Específico para @react-three/fiber y el ecosistema Poimandres"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Three.js","Spécifique à @react-three/fiber et à l''écosystème Poimandres"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Three.js","Spezifisch für @react-three/fiber und das Poimandres-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Three.js","Específico para @react-three/fiber e ecossistema Poimandres"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Three.js","Специфичен для @react-three/fiber и экосистемы Poimandres"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و Three.js","محدد لـ @react-three/fiber وبيئة Poimandres"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4782e1666bd52b07a958a83671af91c66a54313cdd7e61269bff0ebc6772dad7","qualityScore":44}');
