로 변환합니다","es":"Playwright-excel es una herramienta de automatización que utiliza Playwright y Excel para simplificar la configuración","fr":"Playwright-excel est un outil d''automatisation qui utilise Playwright et Excel pour simplifier la configuration","de":"Playwright-excel ist ein Automatisierungstool, das Playwright und Excel verwendet, um die Konfiguration zu vereinfachen","pt":"O que é Playwright Excel? É uma ferramenta de automação que integra Playwright com o Excel","ru":"Что такое Playwright Excel? Это инструмент для автоматизации, который интегрирует Playwright с Excel","ar":"ما هي أداة Playwright Excel؟ هي أداة آليّة تدمج Playwright مع برنامج Excel"},"features":{"en":["Converts Playwright codegen script paths into Excel-driven automations","Requires execution within the `playwright` conda environment","Validates inputs using Playwright CLI","Maps hardcoded values from scripts to Excel data via `.xlsx` files","Uses `conda run -n playwright python` for Python command execution","Explicitly prohibits the use of venv or .venv environments"],"zh":["使用Playwright codegen脚本","支持Excel .xlsx文件","集中化配置和CLI验证","使用conda环境","支持Python脚本执行"],"ja":["Playwright codegenスクリプトを使用","Excel .xlsxファイルをサポート","集中化された構成とCLI検証","conda環境を使用","Pythonスクリプトの実行をサポート"],"ko":["Playwright codegen 스크립트 사용","Excel .xlsx 파일 지원","집중화된 구성과 CLI 검증","conda 환경 사용","Python 스크립트 실행 지원"],"es":["Conversión de scripts de codegen de Playwright en automatizaciones con Excel","Configuración centralizada para una fácil administración","Validación de CLI de Playwright para garantizar la compatibilidad","Uso del entorno conda para una instalación segura","Compatibilidad con archivos Excel (.xlsx) para una fácil integración"],"fr":["Conversion de scripts de codegen de Playwright en automatisations Excel","Configuration centralisée pour une administration facile","Validation de la CLI de Playwright pour garantir la compatibilité","Utilisation de l''environnement conda pour une installation sécurisée","Compatibilité avec les fichiers Excel (.xlsx) pour une intégration facile"],"de":["Umwandlung von Playwright-Codegen-Skripten in Excel-Automatisierungen","Zentrale Konfiguration für eine einfache Verwaltung","Validierung der Playwright-CLI für Kompatibilitätsgarantie","Verwendung der conda-Umgebung für eine sichere Installation","Kompatibilität mit Excel-Dateien (.xlsx) für eine einfache Integration"],"pt":["Integração com o Playwright para automação centralizada","Validação via CLI para garantir a compatibilidade","Suporte a scripts de codegen para automação personalizada","Uso do ambiente conda para execução de comandos Python","Compatibilidade com arquivos Excel (.xlsx) para mapeamento de linhas"],"ru":["Интеграция с Playwright для централизованной автоматизации","Валидация через CLI для обеспечения совместимости","Поддержка сценариев codegen для настройки автоматизации","Использование окружения conda для выполнения команд Python","Совместимость с файлами Excel (.xlsx) для сопоставления строк"],"ar":["تكامل مع Playwright لتحقيق آليّة مركزية","التصديق عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر لضمان التوافق","دعم البرامج النصية المولّدة تلقائيًا لتحقيق آليّة مخصصة","استخدام بيئة conda لتنفيذ أوامر Python","التوافق مع ملفات Excel (.xlsx) لمapping السطور"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use playwright-excel","what is playwright-excel","playwright excel integration","playwright codegen to excel","playwright-excel setup guide","playwright-excel install","playwright-excel vs selenium excel","browser automation with excel","playwright conda environment"],"zh":["Playwright Excel集成","codegen脚本","Excel驱动自动化","集中化配置","CLI验证","conda环境","Python脚本执行","AIエージェント工具"],"ja":["Playwright Excel統合","codegenスクリプト","Excel駆動自動化","集中化された構成","CLI検証","conda環境","Pythonスクリプト実行","AIエージェントツール"],"ko":["Playwright Excel 통합","codegen 스크립트","Excel 드라이버 자동화","집중화된 구성","CLI 검증","conda 환경","Python 스크립트 실행","AI 에이전트 도구"],"es":["playwright-excel","automatización con excel","configuración centralizada","validación de cli","conda environment","integración con excel","herramientas de automatización","agentes de ia","playwright codegen"],"fr":["playwright-excel","automatisation avec excel","configuration centralisée","validation de cli","environnement conda","intégration avec excel","outils d''automatisation","agents d''ia","playwright codegen","outils de développement"],"de":["playwright-excel","automatisierung mit excel","zentrale konfiguration","validierung der cli","conda-umgebung","integration mit excel","automatisierungstools","künstliche intelligents agents","playwright codegen","entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Playwright Excel","automação centralizada","validação CLI","codegen","conda","Python","Excel","integração Playwright"],"ru":["Playwright Excel","централизованная автоматизация","валидация CLI","codegen","conda","Python","Excel","интеграция Playwright"],"ar":["Playwright Excel","آليّة مركزية","تصديق واجهة سطر الأوامر","برامج نصية مولّدة تلقائيًا","conda","Python","Excel","تكامل Playwright"]}},"owner":"Rukkha1024","repo":"post_auto_work","repoPath":"Rukkha1024/post_auto_work","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.428Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwright-excel","description":"Integrate Excel (.xlsx) data into Playwright codegen scripts by replacing hardcoded values with config-driven lookups, loading data with polars, and validating every step with Playwright CLI plus the Playwright CLI skill. Use for Playwright automation updates that require Excel-backed data, config.yaml centralization, or CLI-based validation/reporting.","bodyPreview":"# Playwright Excel Integration\n\n## Overview\nConvert Playwright codegen scripts into Excel-driven automations with centralized config and required Playwright CLI validation.\n\n## Environment\n- Use the `playwright` conda environment.\n- Before running any Python command, run: `conda run -n playwright python -c \"import sys; print(sys.executable)\"`\n- Do not create or activate any venv or `.venv`.\n\n## Inputs\n- Playwright codegen script path\n- Excel `.xlsx` path\n- Mapping lines: `\"hardcoded_value\" -> Ex","body":"# Playwright Excel Integration\n\n## Overview\nConvert Playwright codegen scripts into Excel-driven automations with centralized config and required Playwright CLI validation.\n\n## Environment\n- Use the `playwright` conda environment.\n- Before running any Python command, run: `conda run -n playwright python -c \"import sys; print(sys.executable)\"`\n- Do not create or activate any venv or `.venv`.\n\n## Inputs\n- Playwright codegen script path\n- Excel `.xlsx` path\n- Mapping lines: `\"hardcoded_value\" -> Excel[Sheet][FilterCol==FilterVal][DataCol]`\n- Optional override: `PLAYWRIGHT_TARGET_SUBJECT`\n\n## Workflow\n1. Analyze the Playwright script and the Excel structure (sheets, columns, sample rows).\n2. Detect hardcoded `.fill()` values and confirm that each has a mapping; request clarification for mismatches.\n3. Ensure dependencies in the `playwright` conda env (prefer `conda install -n playwright`, fall back to `conda run -n playwright pip install`).\n4. Create or update `config.yaml` using centralized control (paths, patterns, column definitions, constants, tunables, shared texts).\n5. Modify the Playwright script:\n   - Add a config loader and an Excel loader (polars; see `references/excel-loading.md`).\n   - Replace hardcoded values with `data[...]`.\n6. Always run Playwright CLI validation using the Playwright CLI skill before continuing (see `references/mcp-validation.md`).\n7. When refactoring existing pipelines/logic, generate outputs and compare MD5 checksums with reference files (see `references/md5-validation.md`).\n8. Run the updated script with `conda run -n playwright python`.\n\n## References\n- `references/excel-loading.md`\n- `references/mcp-validation.md`\n- `references/md5-validation.md`\n- `references/examples.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:29.272Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for QA Automation Agents converting Playwright codegen scripts into Excel-driven browser testing workflows.","zh":"适合用于 QA 自动化代理，将 Playwright 代码生成脚本转换为 Excel 驱动的浏览器测试工作流。","ja":"QA 自動化エージェントが Playwright コード生成スクリプトを Excel ドライブのブラウザ テスト ワークフローに変換する場合に最適です。","ko":"QA 자동화 에이전트가 Playwright 코드 생성 스크립트를 Excel 드라이브 브라우저 테스트 워크플로우로 변환하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de QA que convierten scripts de codegen de Playwright en flujos de pruebas de navegador impulsados por Excel.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation de QA qui convertissent des scripts de codegen de Playwright en flux de tests de navigateur alimentés par Excel.","de":"Ideal für QA-Automatisierungsagenten, die Playwright-Codegen-Skripte in Excel-getriebene Browser-Test-Workflows umwandeln.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de automação de QA que convertem scripts de código do Playwright em fluxos de trabalho de teste de navegador impulsionados por Excel.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации QA, преобразующих скрипты генерации кода Playwright в рабочие процессы тестирования браузера, управляемые Excel.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحويل وكيل آلي لتحويل نصوص مولد كود Playwright إلى سير عمل اختبار المتصفح التي تعمل بالاستناد إلى برنامج إكسل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to transform Playwright codegen scripts into Excel-driven automations with centralized configuration management. Provides CLI validation capabilities for maintaining test integrity and data flow consistency across browser automation scenarios.","zh":"使代理能够将 Playwright 代码生成脚本转换为具有集中配置管理的 Excel 驱动自动化。提供 CLI 验证功能以保持测试完整性和浏览器自动化场景中的数据流一致性。","ja":"エージェントが Playwright コード生成スクリプトを集中管理された構成管理を備えた Excel ドライブの自動化に変換できるようにします。ブラウザ自動化シナリオ全体でテストの完全性とデータフローの一貫性を維持するための CLI 検証機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Playwright 코드 생성 스크립트를 중앙 집중식 구성 관리를 갖춘 Excel 드라이브 자동화로 변환할 수 있도록 합니다. 브라우저 자동화 시나리오 전반에서 테스트의 완전성과 데이터 흐름의 일관성을 유지하는 CLI 검증 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes transformar scripts de codegen de Playwright en automatizaciones impulsadas por Excel con gestión de configuración centralizada. Proporciona capacidades de validación de CLI para mantener la integridad de las pruebas y la consistencia del flujo de datos en escenarios de automatización de navegador.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des scripts de codegen de Playwright en automatisations alimentées par Excel avec une gestion de configuration centralisée. Fournit des capacités de validation de CLI pour maintenir l''intégrité des tests et la cohérence du flux de données dans les scénarios d''automatisation de navigateur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Playwright-Codegen-Skripte in Excel-getriebene Automatisierungen mit zentraler Konfigurationsverwaltung umzuwandeln. Bietet CLI-Validierungsfunktionen für die Aufrechterhaltung der Testintegrität und die Konsistenz des Datenflusses in Browser-Automatisierungsszenarien.","pt":"Permite que os agentes transformem scripts de código do Playwright em automação impulsionada por Excel com gerenciamento de configuração centralizado. Fornece capacidades de validação da CLI para manter a integridade dos testes e a consistência do fluxo de dados em cenários de automação de navegador.","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать скрипты генерации кода Playwright в автоматизацию, управляемую Excel, с центральным управлением конфигурацией. Предоставляет возможности валидации CLI для поддержания целостности тестов и согласованности потока данных в сценариях автоматизации браузера.","ar":"يمكن للوكيل تحويل نصوص مولد كود Playwright إلى عمليات آليّة مدفوعة ببرنامج إكسل مع إدارة تكوين مركزية. يوفر إمكانات التحقق من CLI للحفاظ على سلامة الاختبارات وتوافق تدفق البيانات عبر سيناريوهات آليّة المتصفح."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting Playwright codegen scripts to Excel test suites","Centralizing test configuration management","Validating automation flows through Playwright CLI","Managing test data and flows in Excel spreadsheets"],"zh":["将 Playwright 代码生成脚本转换为 Excel 测试套件","集中测试配置管理","通过 Playwright CLI 验证自动化流程","在 Excel 电子表格中管理测试数据和流程"],"ja":["Playwright コード生成スクリプトを Excel テスト スイートに変換する","テスト構成管理を集中化する","Playwright CLI を使用して自動化フローを検証する","Excel スプレッドシートでテスト データとフローを管理する"],"ko":["Playwright 코드 생성 스크립트를 Excel 테스트 세트로 변환하는 것","테스트 구성 관리를 중앙 집중화하는 것","Playwright CLI를 사용하여 자동화 흐름을 검증하는 것","Excel 전자 테이블에서 테스트 데이터와 흐름을 관리하는 것"],"es":["Conversión de scripts de codegen de Playwright en suites de pruebas de Excel","Centralización de la gestión de configuración de pruebas","Validación de flujos de automatización a través de Playwright CLI","Gestión de datos de prueba y flujos en hojas de cálculo de Excel"],"fr":["Conversion de scripts de codegen de Playwright en suites de tests Excel","Centralisation de la gestion de configuration de tests","Validation de flux d''automatisation via Playwright CLI","Gestion de données de test et de flux dans les feuilles de calcul Excel"],"de":["Umwandlung von Playwright-Codegen-Skripten in Excel-Test-Suiten","Zentralisierung der Testkonfigurationsverwaltung","Validierung von Automatisierungsflüssen über Playwright-CLI","Verwaltung von Testdaten und -flüssen in Excel-Tabellen"],"pt":["Conversão de scripts de código do Playwright em conjuntos de testes do Excel","Centralização do gerenciamento de configuração de teste","Validação de fluxos de automação por meio da CLI do Playwright","Gerenciamento de dados de teste e fluxos em planilhas do Excel"],"ru":["Преобразование скриптов генерации кода Playwright в наборы тестов Excel","Централизация управления конфигурацией тестирования","Валидация потоков автоматизации с помощью CLI Playwright","Управление тестовыми данными и потоками в таблицах Excel"],"ar":["تحويل نصوص مولد كود Playwright إلى مجموعات اختبار إكسل","تجديد تدوير إدارة تكوين الاختبار","التحقق من سلاسل عمليات آليّة باستخدام واجهة سطر أوامر Playwright","إدارة بيانات الاختبار والتدفقات في جداول برنامج إكسل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires conda playwright environment","Needs Playwright CLI for validation","Excel .xlsx file format specific","No virtual environment support (.venv prohibited)"],"zh":["需要 conda playwright 环境","需要 Playwright CLI 进行验证","仅支持 Excel .xlsx 文件格式","不支持虚拟环境 (.venv 禁止)"],"ja":["conda playwright 環境が必要","検証には Playwright CLI が必要","Excel .xlsx ファイル形式のみをサポート","仮想環境 (.venv) はサポートされません"],"ko":["conda playwright 환경이 필요","검증을 위해 Playwright CLI가 필요","Excel .xlsx 파일 형식만 지원","가상 환경(.venv) 지원 안 함"],"es":["Requiere entorno de conda playwright","Necesita Playwright CLI para la validación","Formato de archivo .xlsx de Excel específico","No se admite el entorno virtual (.venv prohibitivo)"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement conda playwright","A besoin de Playwright CLI pour la validation","Format de fichier .xlsx Excel spécifique","Aucun support d''environnement virtuel (.venv interdit)"],"de":["Benötigt conda-Playwright-Umgebung","Benötigt Playwright-CLI für die Validierung","Excel-.xlsx-Dateiformat spezifisch","Keine Unterstützung für virtuelle Umgebungen (.venv verboten)"],"pt":["Requer ambiente do conda playwright","Necessita da CLI do Playwright para validação","Específico do formato de arquivo .xlsx do Excel","Sem suporte a ambiente virtual (.venv proibido)"],"ru":["Требуется среда conda playwright","Необходимо использовать CLI Playwright для валидации","Специфичен для формата файла Excel .xlsx","Нет поддержки виртуальной среды (.venv запрещен)"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة conda playwright","يحتاج إلى واجهة سطر أوامر Playwright للتحقق","محدد لتنسيق ملف إكسل .xlsx","لا يدعم بيئة افتراضية (.venv محظور)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"586bac4cea916ef62e39751488a2e323eee10069dc2910b55b42d3f47470e2bc","qualityScore":44}');
