астроить Conductor для создания артефактов, совместимых с расширением Gemini Conductor и его рабочим процессом","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد موصل لإنشاء مكونات متوافقة مع ملحق Gemini Conductor وعمليته"},"definition":{"en":"Conductor is a skill for creating and maintaining Conductor artifacts to ensure compatibility with the Gemini Conductor extension and its workflow.","zh":"Conductor兼容性技能是一种Codex技能，用于创建和维护Conductor工件以确保与Gemini Conductor扩展和工作流程的兼容性","ja":"Conductor相互運用性スキルは、Gemini Conductor拡張機能およびワークフローとの互換性を確保するためにConductorアーティファクトを作成および維持するCodexスキルの一種です","ko":"Conductor 호환성 스킬은 Gemini Conductor 확장 및 워크플로우와의 호환성을 보장하는 데 Conductor 아티팩트를 생성 및 유지하는 Codex 스킬의 일종입니다","es":"Conductor es una skill de IA de Codex diseñada para gestionar la compatibilidad de proyectos con la extensión Gemini Conductor. Crea y mantiene automáticamente una estructura de archivos específica (conductor/product.md, setup_state.json, etc.) para alinearse con su metodología de workflow.","fr":"Conductor est un outil IA Codex conçu pour gérer la compatibilité des projets avec l''extension Gemini Conductor. Il crée et entretient automatiquement une structure de fichiers spécifique (conductor/product.md, setup_state.json, etc.) pour s''aligner sur sa méthodologie de workflow.","de":"Conductor ist ein Codex KI-Tool, das die Projektkompatibilität mit der Gemini Conductor-Erweiterung verwaltet. Es erstellt und pflegt automatisch eine spezifische Dateistruktur (conductor/product.md, setup_state.json, etc.), um sich an deren Workflow-Methodik anzupassen.","pt":"O Conductor é uma habilidade de codex que cria artefatos compatíveis com a extensão Gemini Conductor","ru":"Conductor - это навык кодекса, который создает артефакты, совместимые с расширением Gemini Conductor","ar":"موصل هو مهارة كودكس لإنشاء مكونات متوافقة مع ملحق Gemini Conductor"},"features":{"en":["Creates product.md files for project context setup","Generates tech-stack.md files for tracking technical dependencies","Maintains setup_state.json files for workflow management","Supports implementation and resumption of tracks via workflow.md files","Ensures compatibility with Gemini Conductor extension and its workflow","Requires a specific file structure for Conductor artifacts"],"zh":["支持设置新项目上下文","开始新轨道","实现或恢复轨道","检查进度","还原工作","维护Conductor工件兼容性"],"ja":["新しいプロジェクトコンテキストの設定をサポート","新的軌道の開始","軌道の実装または再開","進度の確認","作業の復元","Conductorアーティファクトの互換性を維持"],"ko":["새로운 프로젝트 컨텍스트 설정 지원","新的 트랙 시작","트랙 구현 또는 재개","진행 상황 확인","작업 되돌리기","Conductor 아티팩트 호환성 유지"],"es":["Generación automática de la estructura de archivos conductor/ requerida","Mantenimiento de artefactos para compatibilidad con la extensión Gemini","Gestión del contexto del proyecto para nuevos tracks o implementaciones","Soporte para revisar el progreso y revertir el trabajo","Creación y gestión del archivo de estado setup_state.json","Adherencia estricta al flujo de trabajo Context -> Spec & Plan -> Implement"],"fr":["Génération automatique de la structure de fichiers conductor/ requise","Maintenance des artefacts pour la compatibilité avec l''extension Gemini","Gestion du contexte projet pour nouvelles pistes ou implémentations","Prise en charge de la vérification des progrès et de l''annulation du travail","Création et gestion du fichier d''état setup_state.json","Adhérence stricte au flux de travail Contexte -> Spécification & Plan -> Implémentation"],"de":["Automatische Generierung der erforderlichen conductor/ Dateistruktur","Wartung von Artefakten für Kompatibilität mit der Gemini-Erweiterung","Verwaltung des Projektkontexts für neue Tracks oder Implementierungen","Unterstützung für Fortschrittsprüfung und Rückgängigmachen von Arbeit","Erstellung und Verwaltung der Statusdatei setup_state.json","Strikte Einhaltung des Workflows Kontext -> Spezifikation & Plan -> Implementierung"],"pt":["Criação de artefatos compatíveis com a extensão Gemini Conductor","Gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho com Context, Spec, Plan e Implement","Utilização de arquivos como product.md, product-guidelines.md e tech-stack.md","Configuração de novos projetos com setup_state.json","Compatibilidade com a extensão Gemini Conductor"],"ru":["Создание артефактов, совместимых с расширением Gemini Conductor","Управление рабочим процессом с Context, Spec, Plan и Implement","Использование файлов như product.md, product-guidelines.md и tech-stack.md","Настройка новых проектов с setup_state.json","Совместимость с расширением Gemini Conductor"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات متوافقة مع ملحق Gemini Conductor","إدارة العملية مع السياق والتفاصيل والخطة والتنفيذ","استخدام الملفات مثل product.md و product-guidelines.md و tech-stack.md","إعداد مشاريع جديدة مع setup_state.json","التوافق مع ملحق Gemini Conductor"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use conductor","conductor setup guide","conductor vs gemini","conductor install","what is conductor","conductor alternative","conductor workflow management","gemini conductor extension","conductor compatibility"],"zh":["Conductor兼容性","Gemini Conductor扩展","Codex技能","Conductor工件","工作流程兼容性","项目上下文设置","轨道开始","进度检查"],"ja":["Conductor相互運用性","Gemini Conductor拡張機能","Codexスキル","Conductorアーティファクト","ワークフロー互換性","プロジェクトコンテキスト設定","軌道開始","進度確認"],"ko":["Conductor 호환성","Gemini Conductor 확장","Codex 스킬","Conductor 아티팩트","워크플로우 호환성","프로젝트 컨텍스트 설정","트랙 시작","진행 상황 확인"],"es":["skill conductor ia","compatibilidad extensión gemini","estructura archivos conductor","setup_state.json","gestión contexto proyecto","flujo de trabajo conductor","automatización artefactos desarrollo","codex skill para desarrolladores"],"fr":["outil ia conductor","compatibilité extension gemini","structure fichiers conductor","setup_state.json","gestion contexte projet","flux de travail conductor","automatisation artefacts développement","codex outil pour développeurs"],"de":["ki-tool conductor","kompatibilität gemini erweiterung","dateistruktur conductor","setup_state.json","projektkontext verwalten","conductor workflow","automatisierung entwicklungsartefakte","codex tool für entwickler"],"pt":["Conductor","Gemini Conductor","Artefatos compatíveis","Fluxo de trabalho","Configuração de projetos","Setup_state.json","Product.md","Tech-stack.md","Codex"],"ru":["Conductor","Gemini Conductor","Совместимые артефакты","Рабочий процесс","Настройка проектов","Setup_state.json","Product.md","Tech-stack.md","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["موصل","Gemini Conductor","مكونات متوافقة","العملية","إعداد المشاريع","Setup_state.json","Product.md","Tech-stack.md","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"pythrick","repo":"codex-conductor","repoPath":"pythrick/codex-conductor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"conductor","description":"Maintain Conductor-compatible project context, tracks, specs, and plans.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Conductor Compatibility Skill\n\nPurpose: create and maintain Conductor artifacts so they remain fully compatible with the Gemini Conductor extension and its workflow (Context -> Spec & Plan -> Implement).\n\nUse this skill when the user asks to set up a new project context, start a new track, implement or resume a track, check progress, or revert work.\n\n## Required File Structure (Do Not Deviate)\n\n```\nconductor/\n  product.md\n  product-guidelines.md\n  tech-stack.md\n  workflow.md\n  setup_state.json","body":"# Conductor Compatibility Skill\n\nPurpose: create and maintain Conductor artifacts so they remain fully compatible with the Gemini Conductor extension and its workflow (Context -> Spec & Plan -> Implement).\n\nUse this skill when the user asks to set up a new project context, start a new track, implement or resume a track, check progress, or revert work.\n\n## Required File Structure (Do Not Deviate)\n\n```\nconductor/\n  product.md\n  product-guidelines.md\n  tech-stack.md\n  workflow.md\n  setup_state.json\n  code_styleguides/\n    *.md\n  tracks.md\n  tracks/\n    <track_id>/\n      spec.md\n      plan.md\n      metadata.json\n  archive/                 (optional)\n    <track_id>/            (optional)\n```\n\n## Required Formats\n\n### Track ID\n- Format: `shortname_YYYYMMDD` (lowercase ASCII, underscores only).\n- Example: `auth_20251219`.\n\n### `conductor/tracks.md`\n- Must use `---` separators between track sections.\n- Each track section must use the exact heading format below.\n\n```\n---\n\n## [ ] Track: <Track Description>\n*Link: [./conductor/tracks/<track_id>/](./conductor/tracks/<track_id>/)*\n```\n\n### `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/metadata.json`\n- Required keys: `track_id`, `type`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `description`.\n- Timestamps are ISO 8601 UTC, e.g., `2025-12-19T23:59:59Z`.\n- `status` values: `new`, `in_progress`, `completed`, `cancelled`.\n\n### `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/plan.md`\n- Use checklist markers: `[ ]` (pending), `[~]` (in progress), `[x]` (done).\n- When completing a task, append the first 7 chars of the commit SHA to the task line.\n- If the workflow defines the Phase Completion Verification protocol, append a meta-task to each phase:\n  `- [ ] Task: Conductor - User Manual Verification ''<Phase Name>'' (Protocol in workflow.md)`\n- When a phase is checkpointed, append `[checkpoint: <sha>]` to the phase heading.\n\n## Setup Workflow (Greenfield or Brownfield)\n\n1. Detect project maturity (greenfield vs brownfield) based on repo and code presence.\n2. Create `conductor/` and `conductor/setup_state.json` if missing. Start with:\n   `{ \"last_successful_step\": \"\" }`\n3. Generate or update the core documents with user input:\n   - `product.md`\n   - `product-guidelines.md`\n   - `tech-stack.md`\n4. Copy the workflow template from `assets/templates/workflow.md` into `conductor/workflow.md` unless the user provides a custom workflow.\n5. Copy code style guides from `assets/templates/code_styleguides/` into `conductor/code_styleguides/`.\n6. Initialize `conductor/tracks.md` using the format in `assets/templates/tracks.md`.\n7. Create the initial track folder and artifacts (`spec.md`, `plan.md`, `metadata.json`).\n8. Update `conductor/setup_state.json` as steps complete using these values:\n   - `2.1_product_guide`\n   - `2.2_product_guidelines`\n   - `2.3_tech_stack`\n   - `2.4_code_styleguides`\n   - `2.5_workflow`\n   - `3.3_initial_track_generated`\n\n## New Track Workflow\n\n1. Confirm Conductor is set up (`product.md`, `tech-stack.md`, `workflow.md` exist).\n2. Collect or confirm a track description.\n3. Draft and confirm `spec.md` (requirements, acceptance criteria, out of scope).\n4. Draft and confirm `plan.md` based on `workflow.md` (TDD steps if required).\n5. Create `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/` with `spec.md`, `plan.md`, `metadata.json`.\n6. Append the track section to `conductor/tracks.md` using the required format.\n\n## Implement Workflow\n\n1. Parse `conductor/tracks.md` by `---` separators and select the target track.\n2. Mark the selected track as `[~]` in `conductor/tracks.md` before work starts.\n3. Read `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/spec.md`, `plan.md`, and `conductor/workflow.md`.\n4. Execute tasks strictly following the Task Workflow in `workflow.md` (including tests, commits, git notes, and plan updates).\n5. When the track is complete, mark the track as `[x]` in `conductor/tracks.md`.\n6. Synchronize `product.md`, `tech-stack.md`, and `product-guidelines.md` when the spec warrants it, with explicit user approval.\n7. Offer to archive or delete the completed track. If archiving, move it to `conductor/archive/<track_id>` and remove its section from `tracks.md`.\n\n## Status Workflow\n\n- Verify Conductor setup and `conductor/tracks.md` exists.\n- Summarize counts of tracks and tasks (done/in progress/pending).\n- Report current phase/task and next action.\n\n## Revert Workflow\n\n- Confirm the target track/phase/task from `tracks.md` and `plan.md`.\n- Use git history to identify associated commits.\n- Present a clear revert plan and wait for explicit user confirmation before executing any destructive action.\n\n## Templates Available\n\n- `assets/templates/workflow.md`\n- `assets/templates/code_styleguides/*.md`\n- `assets/templates/tracks.md`\n- `assets/templates/product.md`\n- `assets/templates/product-guidelines.md`\n- `assets/templates/tech-stack.md`\n- `assets/templates/spec.md`\n- `assets/templates/plan.md`\n- `assets/templates/metadata.json`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:30.902Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Workflow Management Agents requiring streamlined project context setup and Gemini Conductor extension compatibility","zh":"适用于需要简化项目上下文设置和兼容Gemini Conductor扩展的工作流管理代理","ja":"Gemini Conductor拡張とそのワークフローとの互換性を保ちつつ、プロジェクトコンテキストの設定を簡素化する必要があるワークフローマネージメントエージェントに適しています","ko":"프로젝트 컨텍스트 설정을 간소화하고 Gemini Conductor 확장 兼容성을 필요로 하는 워크플로우 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Flujos de Trabajo que requieren una configuración de contexto de proyecto optimizada y compatibilidad con la extensión Gemini Conductor","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Gestion de Flux de Travail nécessitant une configuration de contexte de projet optimisée et une compatibilité avec l''extension Gemini Conductor","de":"Ideal für Workflow-Management-Agents, die eine optimierte Projekt-Kontext-Einrichtung und eine Kompatibilität mit der Gemini Conductor-Erweiterung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Workflow que requerem configuração simplificada de contexto de projeto e compatibilidade com a extensão Gemini Conductor","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления рабочими процессами, требующих упрощенной настройки контекста проекта и совместимости с расширением Gemini Conductor","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة سير العمل التي تتطلب إعدادًا مبسطًا لسياق المشروع وتوافقًا مع امتداد Gemini Conductor"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and maintain Conductor artifacts, ensuring compatibility with the Gemini Conductor extension and its workflow, leveraging JSON setup states and Markdown guidelines for seamless context management and track implementation","zh":"赋予代理创建和维护Conductor工件的能力，确保与Gemini Conductor扩展及其工作流的兼容性，利用JSON设置状态和Markdown指南实现无缝的上下文管理和跟踪实现","ja":"エージェントがConductorアーティファクトを作成および維持できるようにし、Gemini Conductor拡張とそのワークフローとの互換性を保ちつつ、JSON設定状態とMarkdownガイドラインを利用してシームレスなコンテキスト管理とトラック実装を実現します","ko":"에이전트가 Conductor 아티팩트를 생성 및 유지할 수 있도록 하여 Gemini Conductor 확장 및 워크플로우와의 호환성을 보장하며, JSON 설정 상태 및 Markdown 지침을 활용하여 무결점의 컨텍스트 관리 및 트랙 구현을 달성합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes crear y mantener artefactos Conductor, garantizando la compatibilidad con la extensión Gemini Conductor y su flujo de trabajo, utilizando estados de configuración JSON y directrices Markdown para una gestión de contexto y seguimiento de implementación sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de maintenir des artefacts Conductor, garantissant la compatibilité avec l''extension Gemini Conductor et son flux de travail, en utilisant des états de configuration JSON et des lignes directrices Markdown pour une gestion de contexte et un suivi de mise en œuvre sans problème","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Conductor-Artefakte zu erstellen und zu warten, wodurch die Kompatibilität mit der Gemini Conductor-Erweiterung und ihrem Workflow sichergestellt wird, indem JSON-Setup-Zustände und Markdown-Richtlinien für eine nahtlose Kontextverwaltung und Implementierungsnachverfolgung verwendet werden","pt":"Capacita os agentes a criar e manter artefatos do Conductor, garantindo compatibilidade com a extensão Gemini Conductor e seu workflow, aproveitando estados de configuração JSON e diretrizes em Markdown para um gerenciamento de contexto contínuo e implementação de track","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и поддерживать артефакты Conductor, обеспечивая совместимость с расширением Gemini Conductor и его рабочим процессом, используя состояния настройки JSON и рекомендации Markdown для беспрерывного управления контекстом и реализации треков","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وصيانة قطع Conductor، مما يضمن التوافق مع امتداد Gemini Conductor وسير العمل الخا