kflow.md和setup_state.json","兼容性仅限于Gemini Conductor扩展"],"ja":["product.md、product-guidelines.md、tech-stack.md、workflow.md、setup_state.jsonを含む特定のファイル構造が必要","Gemini Conductor拡張との互換性のみ"],"ko":["product.md, product-guidelines.md, tech-stack.md, workflow.md 및 setup_state.json을 포함하는 특정 파일 구조 필요","Gemini Conductor 확장과의 호환성만"],"es":["Requiere una estructura de archivo específica con product.md, product-guidelines.md, tech-stack.md, workflow.md y setup_state.json","Compatibilidad limitada a la extensión Gemini Conductor"],"fr":["Nécessite une structure de fichier spécifique avec product.md, product-guidelines.md, tech-stack.md, workflow.md et setup_state.json","Compatibilité limitée à l''extension Gemini Conductor"],"de":["Erfordert eine spezifische Dateistruktur mit product.md, product-guidelines.md, tech-stack.md, workflow.md und setup_state.json","Kompatibilität beschränkt auf die Gemini Conductor-Erweiterung"],"pt":["Requer uma estrutura de arquivos específica com product.md, product-guidelines.md, tech-stack.md, workflow.md e setup_state.json","Compatibilidade limitada à extensão Gemini Conductor"],"ru":["Требует определенной структуры файлов с product.md, product-guidelines.md, tech-stack.md, workflow.md и setup_state.json","Совместимость ограничена расширением Gemini Conductor"],"ar":["يتطلب بنية ملفات محددة تشمل product.md و product-guidelines.md و tech-stack.md و workflow.md و setup_state.json","التوافق يقتصر على امتداد Gemini Conductor"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"eb4d9403b67dd31f4512155c4966bbc44d56120e69b199bbc61dd3b445af9df0","qualityScore":44}');
