U","GLSL","TSL"],"ko":["Three.js 최적화","Three.js 성능 최적화","Three.js 메모리 최적화","Three.js 베스트 프랙티스","Three.js llms","WebGPU","GLSL","TSL"],"es":["mejores prácticas de Three.js","optimización de rendimiento","WebGPU","shaders personalizados","optimización de memoria","reducción de errores","guía de Three.js","reglas de optimización","directrices oficiales de Three.js"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques de Three.js","optimisation des performances","WebGPU","shaders personnalisés","optimisation de la mémoire","réduction des erreurs","guide de Three.js","règles d''optimisation","directives officielles de Three.js"],"de":["besten Praktiken von Three.js","Performance-Optimierung","WebGPU","benutzerdefinierte Shaders","Optimierung des Speichers","Fehlerreduzierung","Leitfaden für Three.js","Optimierungsregeln","offizielle Richtlinien von Three.js"],"pt":["Three.js","Otimização de desempenho","Melhores práticas","Guia de otimização","WebGPU","Shaders personalizados","Otimização de memória"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","Three.js","Оптимизация производительности","Лучшие практики","Руководство по оптимизации","WebGPU","Пользовательские шейдеры","Оптимизация памяти"],"ar":["أفضل ممارسات","ثري جيس","تحسين الأداء","إرشادات تفصيلية","ويب جي بي يو","ملفات الشaders المخصصة","تحسين الذاكرة","تطبيقات ثلاثي الأبعاد"]}},"owner":"rickyraz","repo":"learn-three-typegpu-claude","repoPath":"rickyraz/learn-three-typegpu-claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"three-best-practices","description":"Three.js performance optimization and best practices guidelines. Use when writing, reviewing, or optimizing Three.js code. Triggers on tasks involving 3D scenes, WebGL/WebGPU rendering, geometries, materials, textures, lighting, shaders, or TSL.","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Three.js Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Three.js applications. Contains 100+ rules across 17 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n> Based on official guidelines from Three.js `llms` branch maintained by mrdoob.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Setting up a new Three.js project\n- Writing or reviewing Three.js code\n- Optimizing performance or fixing memory leaks\n- Working with custom shaders (GLSL or TSL)\n- Implementing WebGPU features\n- Buil","body":"# Three.js Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Three.js applications. Contains 100+ rules across 17 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n> Based on official guidelines from Three.js `llms` branch maintained by mrdoob.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Setting up a new Three.js project\n- Writing or reviewing Three.js code\n- Optimizing performance or fixing memory leaks\n- Working with custom shaders (GLSL or TSL)\n- Implementing WebGPU features\n- Building VR/AR experiences with WebXR\n- Integrating physics engines\n- Optimizing for mobile devices\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 0 | Modern Setup & Imports | FUNDAMENTAL | `setup-` |\n| 1 | Memory Management & Dispose | CRITICAL | `memory-` |\n| 2 | Render Loop Optimization | CRITICAL | `render-` |\n| 3 | Geometry & Buffer Management | HIGH | `geometry-` |\n| 4 | Material & Texture Optimization | HIGH | `material-` |\n| 5 | Lighting & Shadows | MEDIUM-HIGH | `lighting-` |\n| 6 | Scene Graph Organization | MEDIUM | `scene-` |\n| 7 | Shader Best Practices (GLSL) | MEDIUM | `shader-` |\n| 8 | TSL (Three.js Shading Language) | MEDIUM | `tsl-` |\n| 9 | Loading & Assets | MEDIUM | `loading-` |\n| 10 | Camera & Controls | LOW-MEDIUM | `camera-` |\n| 11 | Animation System | MEDIUM | `animation-` |\n| 12 | Physics Integration | MEDIUM | `physics-` |\n| 13 | WebXR / VR / AR | MEDIUM | `webxr-` |\n| 14 | Audio | LOW-MEDIUM | `audio-` |\n| 15 | Mobile Optimization | HIGH | `mobile-` |\n| 16 | Production | HIGH | `error-`, `migration-` |\n| 17 | Debug & DevTools | LOW | `debug-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 0. Modern Setup (FUNDAMENTAL)\n\n- `setup-use-import-maps` - Use Import Maps, not old CDN scripts\n- `setup-choose-renderer` - WebGLRenderer (default) vs WebGPURenderer (TSL/compute)\n- `setup-animation-loop` - Use `renderer.setAnimationLoop()` not manual RAF\n- `setup-basic-scene-template` - Complete modern scene template\n\n### 1. Memory Management (CRITICAL)\n\n- `memory-dispose-geometry` - Always dispose geometries\n- `memory-dispose-material` - Always dispose materials and textures\n- `memory-dispose-textures` - Dispose dynamically created textures\n- `memory-dispose-render-targets` - Always dispose WebGLRenderTarget\n- `memory-dispose-recursive` - Use recursive disposal for hierarchies\n- `memory-dispose-on-unmount` - Dispose in React cleanup/unmount\n- `memory-renderer-dispose` - Dispose renderer when destroying view\n- `memory-reuse-objects` - Reuse geometries and materials\n\n### 2. Render Loop (CRITICAL)\n\n- `render-single-raf` - Single requestAnimationFrame loop\n- `render-conditional` - Render on demand for static scenes\n- `render-delta-time` - Use delta time for animations\n- `render-avoid-allocations` - Never allocate in render loop\n- `render-cache-computations` - Cache expensive computations\n- `render-frustum-culling` - Enable frustum culling\n- `render-update-matrix-manual` - Disable auto matrix updates for static objects\n- `render-pixel-ratio` - Limit pixel ratio to 2\n- `render-antialias-wisely` - Use antialiasing judiciously\n\n### 3. Geometry (HIGH)\n\n- `geometry-buffer-geometry` - Always use BufferGeometry\n- `geometry-merge-static` - Merge static geometries\n- `geometry-instanced-mesh` - Use InstancedMesh for identical objects\n- `geometry-lod` - Use Level of Detail for complex models\n- `geometry-index-buffer` - Use indexed geometry\n- `geometry-vertex-count` - Minimize vertex count\n- `geometry-attributes-typed` - Use appropriate typed arrays\n- `geometry-interleaved` - Consider interleaved buffers\n\n### 4. Materials & Textures (HIGH)\n\n- `material-reuse` - Reuse materials across meshes\n- `material-simplest-sufficient` - Use simplest material that works\n- `material-texture-size-power-of-two` - Power-of-two texture dimensions\n- `material-texture-compression` - Use compressed textures (KTX2/Basis)\n- `material-texture-mipmaps` - Enable mipmaps appropriately\n- `material-texture-anisotropy` - Use anisotropic filtering for floors\n- `material-texture-atlas` - Use texture atlases\n- `material-avoid-transparency` - Minimize transparent materials\n- `material-onbeforecompile` - Use onBeforeCompile for shader mods (or TSL)\n\n### 5. Lighting & Shadows (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `lighting-limit-lights` - Minimize dynamic lights\n- `lighting-bake-static` - Bake lighting for static scenes\n- `lighting-shadow-camera-tight` - Fit shadow camera tightly\n- `lighting-shadow-map-size` - Choose appropriate shadow resolution\n- `lighting-shadow-selective` - Enable shadows selectively\n- `lighting-shadow-cascade` - Use CSM for large scenes\n- `lighting-probe` - Use Light Probes\n\n### 6. Scene Graph (MEDIUM)\n\n- `scene-group-objects` - Use Groups for organization\n- `scene-layers` - Use Layers for selective rendering\n- `scene-visible-toggle` - Use visible flag, not add/remove\n- `scene-flatten-static` - Flatten static hierarchies\n- `scene-name-objects` - Name objects for debugging\n- `scene-object-pooling` - Use object pooling\n\n### 7. Shaders GLSL (MEDIUM)\n\n- `shader-precision` - Use appropriate precision\n- `shader-avoid-branching` - Minimize branching\n- `shader-precompute-cpu` - Precompute on CPU\n- `shader-avoid-discard` - Avoid discard, use alphaTest\n- `shader-texture-lod` - Use textureLod for known mip levels\n- `shader-uniform-arrays` - Prefer uniform arrays\n- `shader-varying-interpolation` - Use flat when appropriate\n- `shader-chunk-injection` - Use Three.js shader chunks\n\n### 8. TSL - Three.js Shading Language (MEDIUM)\n\n- `tsl-why-use` - Use TSL instead of onBeforeCompile\n- `tsl-setup-webgpu` - WebGPU setup for TSL\n- `tsl-complete-reference` - Full TSL type system and functions\n- `tsl-material-slots` - Material node properties reference\n- `tsl-node-materials` - Use NodeMaterial classes\n- `tsl-basic-operations` - Types, operations, swizzling\n- `tsl-functions` - Creating TSL functions with Fn()\n- `tsl-conditionals` - If, select, loops in TSL\n- `tsl-textures` - Textures and triplanar mapping\n- `tsl-post-processing` - bloom, blur, dof, ao\n- `tsl-compute-shaders` - GPGPU and compute operations\n- `tsl-glsl-to-tsl` - GLSL to TSL translation\n\n### 9. Loading & Assets (MEDIUM)\n\n- `loading-draco-compression` - Use Draco for large meshes\n- `loading-gltf-preferred` - Use glTF format\n- `gltf-loading-optimization` - Full loader setup with DRACO/Meshopt/KTX2\n- `loading-progress-feedback` - Show loading progress\n- `loading-async-await` - Use async/await for loading\n- `loading-lazy` - Lazy load non-critical assets\n- `loading-cache-assets` - Enable caching\n- `loading-dispose-unused` - Unload unused assets\n\n### 10. Camera & Controls (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `camera-near-far` - Set tight near/far planes\n- `camera-fov` - Choose appropriate FOV\n- `camera-controls-damping` - Use damping for smooth controls\n- `camera-resize-handler` - Handle resize properly\n- `camera-orbit-limits` - Set orbit control limits\n\n### 11. Animation (MEDIUM)\n\n- `animation-system` - AnimationMixer, blending, morph targets, skeletal\n\n### 12. Physics (MEDIUM)\n\n- `physics-integration` - Rapier, Cannon-es integration patterns\n\n### 13. WebXR (MEDIUM)\n\n- `webxr-setup` - VR/AR buttons, controllers, hit testing\n\n### 14. Audio (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `audio-spatial` - PositionalAudio, HRTF, spatial sound\n\n### 15. Optimization (HIGH)\n\n- `mobile-optimization` - Mobile-specific optimizations and checklist\n- `raycasting-optimization` - BVH, layers, GPU picking\n\n### 16. Production (HIGH)\n\n- `error-handling-recovery` - WebGL context loss and recovery\n- `migration-checklist` - Breaking changes by version\n\n### 17. Debug (LOW)\n\n- `debug-stats` - Use Stats.js\n- `debug-helpers` - Use built-in helpers\n- `debug-gui` - Use lil-gui for tweaking\n- `debug-renderer-info` - Check renderer.info\n- `debug-conditional` - Remove debug code in production\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/setup-use-import-maps.md\nrules/memory-dispose-geometry.md\nrules/tsl-complete-reference.md\nrules/mobile-optimization.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- BAD code example with explanation\n- GOOD code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Modern Import Maps\n\n```html\n<script type=\"importmap\">\n{\n  \"imports\": {\n    \"three\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.182.0/build/three.module.js\",\n    \"three/addons/\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.182.0/examples/jsm/\",\n    \"three/tsl\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.182.0/build/three.tsl.js\"\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### Proper Disposal\n\n```javascript\nfunction disposeObject(obj) {\n  if (obj.geometry) obj.geometry.dispose();\n  if (obj.material) {\n    if (Array.isArray(obj.material)) {\n      obj.material.forEach(m => m.dispose());\n    } else {\n      obj.material.dispose();\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### TSL Basic Usage\n\n```javascript\nimport { texture, uv, color, time, sin } from ''three/tsl'';\n\nconst material = new THREE.MeshStandardNodeMaterial();\nmaterial.colorNode = texture(map).mul(color(0xff0000));\nmaterial.colorNode = color(0x00ff00).mul(sin(time).mul(0.5).add(0.5));\n```\n\n### Mobile Detection\n\n```javascript\nconst isMobile = /Android|iPhone|iPad|iPod/i.test(navigator.userAgent);\nrenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, isMobile ? 1.5 : 2));\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:00.449Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Graphics Agents needing advanced Three.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Three.js性能优化功能的图形代理。","ja":"Three.jsの高度なパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするグラフィックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Three.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 그래픽 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes gráficos que necesitan capacidades de optimización de rendimiento avanzadas de Three.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents graphiques ayant besoin de capacités de optimisation de performances avancées de Three.js.","de":"Perfekt für Grafikagenten, die erweiterte Three.js-Leistungsoptimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Gráficos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do Three.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Графических Агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации производительности Three.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الرسومات الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحسين أداء Three.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize Three.js applications with 100+ prioritized rules across 17 categories, leveraging official guidelines from the Three.js `llms` branch for improved WebGPU and custom shader performance.","zh":"赋予代理优化Three.js应用程序的能力，跨17个类别拥有100+优先规则，利用Three.js `llms`分支的官方指南来提高WebGPU和自定义着色器的性能。","ja":"Three.jsアプリケーションを最適化するエージェントの能力を与え、17のカテゴリにわたる100以上の優先ルールを提供し、WebGPUとカスタムシェーダーのパフォーマンスを向上させるためにThree.jsの`llms`ブランチの公式ガイドラインを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Three.js 응용 프로그램을 최적화 할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 17 개의 범주에 걸친 100 개 이상의 우선 순위 규칙을 제공하며 WebGPU 및 사용자 정의 셰이더의 성능을 개선하기 위해 Three.js의 `llms` 분기에 대한 공식 가이드 라인을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones Three.js con más de 100 reglas prioritarias en 17 categorías, aprovechando las guías oficiales de la rama `llms` de Three.js para mejorar el rendimiento de WebGPU y shaders personalizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications Three.js avec plus de 100 règles prioritaires dans 17 catégories, en exploitant les directives officielles de la branche `llms` de Three.js pour améliorer les performances de WebGPU et de shaders personnalisés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Three.js-Anwendungen mit über 100 priorisierten Regeln in 17 Kategorien zu optimieren, indem es offizielle Richtlinien aus dem `llms`-Zweig von Three.js nutzt, um die Leistung von WebGPU und benutzerdefinierten Shadern zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita agentes a otimizar aplicações Three.js com 100+ regras priorizadas em 17 categorias, utilizando diretrizes oficiais do branch `llms` do Three.js para melhorar o desempenho da WebGPU e do shader personalizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения Three.js с более чем 100 приоритизированными правилами в 17 категориях, используя официальные рекомендации из ветки `llms` Three.js для улучшения производительности WebGPU и пользовательских шейдеров.","ar":"تمكين العميل من تحسين تطبيقات Three.js باستخدام أكثر من 100 قاعدة ذات أولوية في 17 فئة ، باستخدام إرشادات رسمية من فرع `llms` من Three.js لتحسين أداء WebGPU والشفرة المخصصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing Three.js project performance","Debugging memory leaks in custom shaders","Implementing WebGPU features for enhanced graphics"],"zh":["优化Three.js项目性能","调试自定义着色器的内存泄漏","实现WebGPU功能以增强图形"],"ja":["Three.jsプロジェクトのパフォーマンスを最適化する","カスタムシェーダーのメモリリークをデバッグする","WebGPU機能を実装してグラフィックスを強化する"],"ko":["Three.js 프로젝트 성능 최적화","사용자 정의 셰이더의 메모리 누수 디버깅","그래픽을 강화하기 위한 WebGPU 기능 구현"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de proyectos Three.js","Depurar fugas de memoria en shaders personalizados","Implementar características de WebGPU para gráficos mejorados"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances des projets Three.js","Déboguer les fuites de mémoire dans les shaders personnalisés","Mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités WebGPU pour des graphiques améliorés"],"de":["Leistung von Three.js-Projekten optimieren","Speichermemory-Leaks in benutzerdefinierten Shadern debuggen","WebGPU-Features für verbesserte Grafik implementieren"],"pt":["Otimizando o desempenho do projeto Three.js","Depurando vazamentos de memória em shaders personalizados","Implementando recursos WebGPU para gráficos aprimorados"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности проекта Three.js","Отладка утечек памяти в пользовательских шейдерах","Реализация функций WebGPU для улучшения графики"],"ar":["تحسين أداء مشروع Three.js","تصحيح أخطاء تسرب الذاكرة في الشفرات المخصصة","تنفيذ ميزات WebGPU لتحسين الرسومات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Three.js and WebGPU","Specific to Three.js applications only"],"zh":["需要了解Three.js和WebGPU","仅适用于Three.js应用程序"],"ja":["Three.jsとWebGPUの知識が必要","Three.jsアプリケーションのみに特化"],"ko":["Three.js와 WebGPU에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","Three.js 응용 프로그램에만 특화되어 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Three.js y WebGPU","Específico para aplicaciones Three.js solamente"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Three.js et WebGPU","Spécifique aux applications Three.js uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Three.js und WebGPU","Spezifisch für Three.js-Anwendungen nur"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de Three.js e WebGPU","Específico para aplicações Three.js apenas"],"ru":["Требует знания Three.js и WebGPU","Относится только к приложениям Three.js"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Three.js و WebGPU","محدد لتطبيقات Three.js فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7492896dc892e6eecd5f33a6a0d02cd455a60a198b3d2ed486fc06ff59442369","qualityScore":44}');
