INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('vinayakkulkarni/v-offline/vue-best-practices', 'vue-best-practices', 'vinayakkulkarni', 'v-offline', 'community', 'vue-best-practices vinayakkulkarni v-offline community The vue-best-practices skill provides a comprehensive performance optimization guide for Vue.js applications, containing 40+ rules to guide automated refactoring and code generation, benefiting developers writing new Vue components or reviewing code for performance issues. Vue.js 性能优化最佳实践提供了 40+ 条规则，用于优化 Vue.js 应用的性能，包括自动化重构和代码生成 Vue.js 最適化ガイドは、Vue.js アプリケーションのパフォーマンス最適化を実現する 40+ のルールを提供します Vue.js 성능 최적화 가이드는 Vue.js 애플리케이션의 성능 최적화를 위한 40+ 규칙을 제공합니다 El conjunto de mejores prácticas de Vue proporciona una guía completa para optimizar el rendimiento de las aplicaciones Vue.js L''ensemble de bonnes pratiques Vue fournit un guide complet pour optimiser les performances des applications Vue.js Die Sammlung von Vue-Best-Practices bietet einen umfassenden Leitfaden für die Performance-Optimierung von Vue.js-Anwendungen Otimização de desempenho para aplicações Vue.js com 40+ regras em 8 categorias Оптимизация производительности для приложений Vue.js с 40+ правилами в 8 категориях для ИИ Агентов تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات فيو جس مع 40+ قاعدة في 8 فئات للعمل مع الإي آي أدوات how to use vue-best-practices vue-best-practices setup guide vue-best-practices vs vue-cli vue-best-practices performance optimization vue-best-practices install what is vue-best-practices vue-best-practices tutorial vue-best-practices alternative vue-best-practices best practices Vue.js 性能优化 Vue.js 最佳实践 AI 技术 自动化重构 代码生成 Composition API Options API Provides 40+ rules across 8 categories for performance optimization Guides automated refactoring and code generation for Vue.js applications Supports reactive state and computed properties optimization Optimizes rendering and re-renders for better performance Works with Composition API and Options API for flexible development vue-best-practices is a set of guidelines for optimizing Vue.js application performance, covering 8 categories with 40+ rules for automated refactoring and code generation.');
