트로, Jest 매처 등 일련의 도구와 구성이 포함되어 있습니다","es":"isentinel es un conjunto de herramientas de desarrollo para rbxts que incluye matchers adicionales para Jest y opiniones sobre herramientas y patrones de desarrollo","fr":"isentinel est un ensemble d''outils de développement pour rbxts qui inclut des matchers supplémentaires pour Jest et des opinions sur les outils et les modèles de développement","de":"isentinel ist ein Satz von Entwicklungstools für rbxts, der zusätzliche Matcher für Jest und Meinungen zu Entwicklungstools und -mustern enthält","pt":"O isentinel é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que fornece recursos adicionais para roblox-ts","ru":"Исентинел - это инструмент разработки, который предоставляет дополнительные функции для роблокс-ts","ar":"أداة isentinel هي أداة تطور توفر مميزات إضافية ل roblox-ts"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes pnpm as the package manager with bun as an optional runtime","Supports TypeScript with strict and extra checks for robust code quality","Includes @isentinel/tsconfig for standardized TypeScript configuration","Employs @isentinel/eslint-config for linting without Prettier","Enhances testing capabilities with additional Jest matchers from jest-extended"],"zh":["Jest 匹配器","pnpm 包管理","TypeScript 配置","严格的 TypeScript 检查","ESLint 配置","无 Prettier"],"ja":["Jest マッチャー","pnpm パッケージマネージャー","TypeScript 構成","厳格な TypeScript 検査","ESLint 構成","Prettier なし"],"ko":["Jest 매처","pnpm 패키지 관리","TypeScript 구성","엄격한 TypeScript 검사","ESLint 구성","Prettier 없음"],"es":["Matchers adicionales para Jest","Soporte para pnpm y bun como gestor de paquetes y runtime","Compatibilidad con TypeScript estricto y controles adicionales","Configuración de TypeScript personalizada con @isentinel/tsconfig","Linting con @isentinel/eslint-config sin Prettier"],"fr":["Matchers supplémentaires pour Jest","Prise en charge de pnpm et bun en tant que gestionnaire de paquets et runtime","Compatibilité avec TypeScript strict et contrôles supplémentaires","Configuration de TypeScript personnalisée avec @isentinel/tsconfig","Linting avec @isentinel/eslint-config sans Prettier"],"de":["Zusätzliche Matcher für Jest","Unterstützung für pnpm und bun als Paketmanager und Runtime","Kompatibilität mit TypeScript-Strict und zusätzlichen Kontrollen","Benutzerdefinierte TypeScript-Konfiguration mit @isentinel/tsconfig","Linting mit @isentinel/eslint-config ohne Prettier"],"pt":["Jest matchers adicionais para rbxts","Suporte a pnpm e bun como gerenciador de pacotes","Configuração de TypeScript com @isentinel/tsconfig","Linting com @isentinel/eslint-config sem Prettier","Testes com Jest"],"ru":["Дополнительные Jest matchers для rbxts","Поддержка pnpm и bun в качестве менеджера пакетов","Настройка TypeScript с @isentinel/tsconfig","Линтинг с @isentinel/eslint-config без Prettier","Тестирование с Jest"],"ar":["Jest matchers إضافية ل rbxts","دعم pnpm و bun كمحلل حزم","ضبط TypeScript مع @isentinel/tsconfig","Linting مع @isentinel/eslint-config بدون Prettier","اختبارات مع Jest"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use isentinel with Jest","isentinel setup guide for roblox-ts","isentinel vs jest-extended","isentinel install for AI agents","what is isentinel in roblox-ts development","isentinel alternative for testing","isentinel and pnpm integration","isentinel TypeScript configuration","isentinel Jest matchers tutorial"],"zh":["isentinel","Roblox-ts","Jest 匹配器","pnpm 包管理","TypeScript 配置","AI エージェント","Roblox-ts 开发","前端开发工具"],"ja":["isentinel","Roblox-ts","Jest マッチャー","pnpm パッケージマネージャー","TypeScript 構成","AI エージェント","Roblox-ts 開発","フロントエンド開発ツール"],"ko":["isentinel","로블록스-ts","Jest 매처","pnpm 패키지 관리","TypeScript 구성","AI 에이전트","로블록스-ts 개발","프론트엔드 개발 도구"],"es":["isentinel","rbxts","Jest","matchers adicionales","pnpm","bun","TypeScript","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","pruebas unitarias"],"fr":["isentinel","rbxts","Jest","matchers supplémentaires","pnpm","bun","TypeScript","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","tests unitaires"],"de":["isentinel","rbxts","Jest","zusätzliche Matcher","pnpm","bun","TypeScript","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Einheitstests"],"pt":["isentinel","roblox-ts","Jest matchers","TypeScript","pnpm","bun","desenvolvimento roblox-ts","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","исентинел","роблокс-ts","Jest matchers","TypeScript","pnpm","bun","разработка роблокс-ts","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","isentinel","roblox-ts","Jest matchers","TypeScript","pnpm","bun","تنمية roblox-ts","أدوات التنمية"]}},"owner":"christopher-buss","repo":"rbxts-jest-extended","repoPath":"christopher-buss/rbxts-jest-extended","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"isentinel","description":"|","version":"2026.1.29","bodyPreview":"# isentinel Preferences\n\nOpinionated tooling and patterns for roblox-ts development.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category          | Preference                             |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| Package Manager   | pnpm (bun as optional runtime)         |\n| Language          | TypeScript (strict + extra checks)     |\n| TypeScript Config | @isentinel/tsconfig                    |\n| Linting           | @isentinel/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing","body":"# isentinel Preferences\n\nOpinionated tooling and patterns for roblox-ts development.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category          | Preference                             |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| Package Manager   | pnpm (bun as optional runtime)         |\n| Language          | TypeScript (strict + extra checks)     |\n| TypeScript Config | @isentinel/tsconfig                    |\n| Linting           | @isentinel/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing           | Jest-roblox, TDD approach              |\n| Git Hooks         | husky + lint-staged                    |\n| Commits           | Conventional Commits                   |\n\n---\n\n## Package Manager (pnpm)\n\nUse pnpm as the package manager. Can use bun as runtime for scripts.\n\n### @antfu/ni\n\nUse `@antfu/ni` for unified package manager commands (It auto-detects the\npackage manager (pnpm/npm/yarn/bun) based on lockfile):\n\n| Command       | Description          |\n| ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `ni`          | Install dependencies |\n| `ni <pkg>`    | Add dependency       |\n| `ni -D <pkg>` | Add dev dependency   |\n| `nr <script>` | Run script           |\n| `nu`          | Upgrade dependencies |\n| `nun <pkg>`   | Uninstall dependency |\n| `nci`         | Clean install        |\n| `nlx <pkg>`   | Execute package      |\n\n---\n\n## TypeScript\n\nUse `@isentinel/tsconfig` with the roblox preset. Strict mode plus additional\nchecks:\n\n- `exactOptionalPropertyTypes`\n- `noUncheckedIndexedAccess`\n- `noPropertyAccessFromIndexSignature`\n- `noImplicitOverride`\n- `noImplicitReturns`\n- `noFallthroughCasesInSwitch`\n\n```json\n{\n\t\"extends\": \"@isentinel/tsconfig/roblox\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Linting\n\nUse `@isentinel/eslint-config`. No Prettier - ESLint handles formatting.\n\n```ts\n// eslint.config.ts\nimport { isentinel } from \"@isentinel/eslint-config\";\n\nexport default isentinel();\n```\n\nFix errors with `nr lint --fix`.\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\nPrefer assertions over silent failing. Fail fast, fail loud.\n\nSee [error-handling.md](references/error-handling.md) for patterns.\n\n---\n\n## Test-Driven Development\n\nRed → Green → Refactor:\n\n1. Write a failing test\n2. Write minimal code to pass\n3. Refactor with test protection\n\n### Simplicity Rules (in order)\n\n1. Passes all tests\n2. Expresses intent clearly\n3. Contains no duplication\n4. Has minimum elements\n\nThree similar lines of code is better than a premature abstraction.\n\nSee [testing.md](references/testing.md) for Jest-roblox setup.\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n| Topic             | Reference                                         |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| Tooling details   | [tooling.md](references/tooling.md)               |\n| TypeScript config | [typescript.md](references/typescript.md)         |\n| Linting rules     | [linting.md](references/linting.md)               |\n| Testing (TDD)     | [testing.md](references/testing.md)               |\n| Error handling    | [error-handling.md](references/error-handling.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:16.234Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript Automation Agents specializing in Roblox development and testing workflows.","zh":"专为专注于 Roblox 开发和测试工作流的 TypeScript 自动化代理的理想选择。","ja":"Roblox の開発とテストワークフローを専門とする TypeScript オートメーションエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Roblox 개발 및 테스트 워크플로우를 전문으로 하는 TypeScript 자동화 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Automation Agents de TypeScript especializados en flujos de trabajo de desarrollo y testing de Roblox.","fr":"Idéal pour les Automation Agents TypeScript spécialisés dans les flux de travail de développement et de test Roblox.","de":"Ideal für TypeScript Automation Agents, die sich auf Roblox-Entwicklung und Test-Workflows spezialisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação TypeScript especializados em fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento e teste para Roblox.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Automation Agents на TypeScript, специализирующихся на разработке для Roblox и рабочих процессах тестирования.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الأتمتة باستخدام TypeScript المتخصصين في سير عمل تطوير واختبار Roblox."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enhances Jest testing capabilities for rbxts projects with extended matchers from jest-extended, providing opinionated tooling and strict TypeScript patterns. Integrates seamlessly with @isentinel/tsconfig and @isentinel/eslint-config for standardized development environments.","zh":"通过 jest-extended 的扩展匹配器增强 rbxts 项目的 Jest 测试能力，提供固执己见的工具和严格的 TypeScript 模式。与 @isentinel/tsconfig 和 @isentinel/eslint-config 无缝集成，实现标准化开发环境。","ja":"jest-extended からの拡張マッチャーを使用して rbxts プロジェクトの Jest テスト機能を強化し、意見のあるツールと厳格な TypeScript パターンを提供します。標準化された開発環境のために @isentinel/tsconfig および @isentinel/eslint-config とシームレスに統合します。","ko":"jest-extended의 확장 매처를 통해 rbxts 프로젝트의 Jest 테스트 기능을 향상시키고, 의견이 반영된 도구와 엄격한 TypeScript 패턴을 제공합니다. 표준화된 개발 환경을 위해 @isentinel/tsconfig 및 @isentinel/eslint-config와 원활하게 통합됩니다.","es":"Mejora las capacidades de testing de Jest para proyectos rbxts con matchers extendidos de jest-extended, proporcionando herramientas opinadas y patrones estrictos de TypeScript. Se integra perfectamente con @isentinel/tsconfig y @isentinel/eslint-config para entornos de desarrollo estandarizados.","fr":"Améliore les capacités de test de Jest pour les projets rbxts avec des matchers étendus de jest-extended, fournissant des outils opinés et des modèles TypeScript stricts. S''intègre parfaitement avec @isentinel/tsconfig et @isentinel/eslint-config pour des environnements de développement standardisés.","de":"Erweitert die Jest-Testfähigkeiten für rbxts-Projekte mit erweiterten Matchers von jest-extended und bietet opionierte Tools und strikte TypeScript-Muster. Integriert sich nahtlos mit @isentinel/tsconfig und @isentinel/eslint-config für standardisierte Entwicklungsumgebungen.","pt":"Aprimora as capacidades de teste do Jest para projetos rbxts com matchers estendidos do jest-extended, fornecendo ferramentas opinativas e padrões rigorosos de TypeScript. Integra-se perfeitamente com @isentinel/tsconfig e @isentinel/eslint-config para ambientes de desenvolvimento padronizados.","ru":"Расширяет возможности тестирования Jest для проектов rbxts с помощью расширенных матчеров из jest-extended, предоставляя инструментарий с определенной концепцией и строгие шаблоны TypeScript. Легко интегрируется с @isentinel/tsconfig и @isentinel/eslint-config для стандартизированных сред разработки.","ar":"يعزز قدرات اختبار Jest لمشاريع rbxts مع matchers موسعة من jest-extended، مما يوفر أدوات رأيية وأنواع TypeScript صارمة. يتكامل بسلاسة مع @isentinel/tsconfig و @isentinel/eslint-config لبيئات التطوير الموحدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Extending Jest test coverage for roblox-ts codebases","Enforcing strict TypeScript patterns in Roblox projects","Automating testing workflows with pnpm and bun runtimes"],"zh":["扩展 roblox-ts 代码库的 Jest 测试覆盖率","在 Roblox 项目中强制执行严格的 TypeScript 模式","使用 pnpm 和 bun 运行时自动化测试工作流"],"ja":["roblox-ts コードベースの Jest テストカバレッジの拡張","Roblox プロジェクトでの厳格な TypeScript パターンの強制","pnpm および bun ランタイムを使用したテストワークフローの自動化"],"ko":["roblox-ts 코드베이스의 Jest 테스트 커버리지 확장","Roblox 프로젝트에서 엄격한 TypeScript 패턴 적용","pnpm 및 bun 런타임을 사용한 테스트 워크플로우 자동화"],"es":["Extender la cobertura de pruebas de Jest para codebases de roblox-ts","Hacer cumplir patrones estrictos de TypeScript en proyectos de Roblox","Automatizar flujos de trabajo de testing con los runtimes pnpm y bun"],"fr":["Étendre la couverture de test Jest pour les codebases roblox-ts","Appliquer des modèles TypeScript stricts dans les projets Roblox","Automatiser les flux de travail de test avec les runtimes pnpm et bun"],"de":["Erweitern der Jest-Testabdeckung für roblox-ts-Codebasen","Durchsetzung strikter TypeScript-Muster in Roblox-Projekten","Automatisieren von Test-Workflows mit pnpm- und bun-Laufzeitumgebungen"],"pt":["Estender a cobertura de testes do Jest para bases de código roblox-ts","Impor padrões rigorosos de TypeScript em projetos Roblox","Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de teste com os runtimes pnpm e bun"],"ru":["Расширение покрытия тестов Jest для кодовых баз roblox-ts","Внедрение строгих шаблонов TypeScript в проектах Roblox","Автоматизация рабочих процессов тестирования с помощью сред выполнения pnpm и bun"],"ar":["توسيع نطاخ اختبار Jest لقواعد كود roblox-ts","فرض أنماط TypeScript صارمة في مشاريع Roblox","أتمتة سير عمل الاختبار باستخدام بيئات التشغيل pnpm و bun"]},"limitations":{"en":["Exclusively for rbxts (Roblox TypeScript) development","Requires Jest testing framework integration","Dependent on @isentinel-specific configurations"],"zh":["专用于 rbxts (Roblox TypeScript) 开发","需要 Jest 测试框架集成","依赖于 @isentinel 特定的配置"],"ja":["rbxts (Roblox TypeScript) 開発専用","Jest テストフレームワークの統合が必要","@isentinel 固有の構成に依存"],"ko":["rbxts (Roblox TypeScript) 개발 전용","Jest 테스트 프레임워크 통합 필요","@isentinel 특정 구성에 종속됨"],"es":["Exclusivamente para desarrollo rbxts (Roblox TypeScript)","Requiere integración del framework de testing Jest","Dependiente de configuraciones específicas de @isentinel"],"fr":["Exclusivement pour le développement rbxts (Roblox TypeScript)","Nécessite une intégration du framework de test Jest","Dépend des configurations spécifiques à @isentinel"],"de":["Ausschließlich für die rbxts-Entwicklung (Roblox TypeScript)","Erfordert Integration des Jest-Testframeworks","Abhängig von @isentinel-spezifischen Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Exclusivamente para desenvolvimento rbxts (Roblox TypeScript)","Requer integração com a estrutura de testes Jest","Dependente de configurações específicas do @isentinel"],"ru":["Исключительно для разработки на rbxts (Roblox TypeScript)","Требует интеграции с фреймворком тестирования Jest","Зависит от специфических конфигураций @isentinel"],"ar":["حصريًا لتطوير rbxts (Roblox TypeScript)","يتطلب التكامل مع إطار اختبار Jest","يعتمد على تكوينات @isentinel المحددة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"52c16e5ca636f8d36b9212034a8bc75aa3bbc82d2792c54eda93574826783739","qualityScore":44}');
