de.","zh":"Auto-Debug Command 是一种自动化的 shell 命令执行和调试技能","ja":"Auto-Debug コマンドは、シェルコマンドの自動実行とデバッグを実行する技能のことです","ko":"자동 디버그 명령어는 셸 명령어의 자동 실행과 디버깅을 수행하는 스킬입니다","es":"El auto-debug-command es una herramienta de desarrollo que automatiza la ejecución y depuración de comandos de shell","fr":"L''auto-debug-command est un outil de développement qui automatise l''exécution et le débogage de commandes shell","de":"Das auto-debug-command ist ein Entwicklungstool, das die Ausführung und Fehlersuche von Shell-Befehlen automatisiert","pt":"O que é auto-debug-command? É uma habilidade que automatiza a execução de comandos shell e depuração de erros","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент auto-debug-command? Это habilidade, которая автоматизирует выполнение команд shell и отладку ошибок","ar":"ما هي أوامر Debug التلقائي؟ هي وظيفة تقوم بتشغيل أوامر Shell وتحديد الأخطاء وتحاول إصلاحها"},"features":{"en":["Executes shell commands using run_shell_command in detached mode","Monitors command output for errors and attempts to debug","Fixes identified issues and re-runs the command until successful","Supports commands like docker-compose up with --build and -d flags","Utilizes detached mode for long-running commands"],"zh":["自动执行 shell 命令","监控输出并修复错误","自动重试命令直到成功","支持 detached 模式","集成 run_shell_command 功能"],"ja":["シェルコマンドの自動実行","出力の監視とエラーの修復","コマンドを自動で再実行して成功するまで","detached モードのサポート","run_shell_command 機能の統合"],"ko":["셸 명령어의 자동 실행","출력 모니터링과 오류 수정","명령어를 자동으로 재실행하여 성공할 때까지","detached 모드 지원","run_shell_command 기능 통합"],"es":["Ejecución de comandos de shell en modo detachado","Monitoreo de la salida para detectar errores","Intentos de depuración y corrección de errores","Re-ejecución del comando hasta que se complete con éxito","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como Docker Compose","Soporte para comandos de shell personalizados"],"fr":["Exécution de commandes shell en mode détaché","Surveillance de la sortie pour détecter les erreurs","Tentatives de débogage et de correction des erreurs","Réexécution de la commande jusqu''à ce qu''elle se termine avec succès","Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que Docker Compose","Prise en charge de commandes shell personnalisées"],"de":["Ausführung von Shell-Befehlen im detachierten Modus","Überwachung der Ausgabe zur Erkennung von Fehlern","Versuche zur Fehlersuche und -behebung","Neue Ausführung des Befehls, bis er erfolgreich abgeschlossen ist","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie Docker Compose","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Shell-Befehle"],"pt":["Execução de comandos shell em modo desanexado","Monitoramento da saída para erros","Tentativa de depuração e correção de problemas identificados","Re-execução de comandos até sucesso","Suporte à execução de comandos Docker","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Выполнение команд shell в отсоединённом режиме","Отслеживание вывода для ошибок","Попытка отладки и исправления выявленных проблем","Повторное выполнение команд до успеха","Поддержка выполнения команд Docker","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["تشغيل أوامر Shell في وضع منفصل","مراقبة الإخراج للبحث عن أخطاء","محاولة تصحيح الأخطاء المحددة","إعادة تشغيل الأوامر حتى النجاح","دعم تشغيل أوامر Docker","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use auto-debug-command","auto-debug-command setup guide","auto-debug-command vs manual debugging","what is auto-debug-command","auto-debug-command install","auto-debug-command alternative","automated shell command debugging","run_shell_command in detached mode","docker-compose command debugging"],"zh":["Auto-Debug Command","shell 命令自动执行","输出监控","错误修复","自动重试","detached 模式","run_shell_command"],"ja":["Auto-Debug コマンド","シェルコマンドの自動実行","出力の監視","エラーの修復","自動再実行","detached モード","run_shell_command","AIエージェント"],"ko":["자동 디버그 명령어","셸 명령어의 자동 실행","출력 모니터링","오류 수정","자동 재실행","detached 모드","run_shell_command","AI 에이전트"],"es":["auto-debug-command","herramientas de desarrollo","comandos de shell","depuración de errores","desarrollo de software","docker compose","entorno de desarrollo","automatización de tareas","optimización de procesos"],"fr":["auto-debug-command","outils de développement","commandes shell","débogage d''erreurs","développement de logiciels","docker compose","environnement de développement","automatisation de tâches","optimisation de processus"],"de":["auto-debug-command","Entwicklungstools","Shell-Befehle","Fehlersuche","Software-Entwicklung","Docker Compose","Entwicklungsumgebung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Prozessoptimierung"],"pt":["auto-debug-command","comandos shell","depuração de erros","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Docker","CLI","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ИИ Агент auto-debug-command","команды shell","отладка ошибок","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","Docker","CLI","разработчики"],"ar":["أوامر Debug التلقائي","أوامر Shell","تصحيح الأخطاء","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","Docker","CLI","مطورون"]}},"owner":"kimthiphuongthao","repo":"failover_openig","repoPath":"kimthiphuongthao/failover_openig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.602Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"auto-debug-command","description":"Automatically executes a shell command, monitors logs for errors, and iteratively applies fixes until successful. Use when a command requires self-healing execution.","bodyPreview":"# Auto-Debug Command Execution\n\nThis skill automates the process of executing a shell command, monitoring its output for errors, attempting to debug and fix identified issues, and re-running the command until it succeeds.\n\n## Workflow\n\nWhen this skill is activated with a shell command, follow these steps:\n\n1.  **Execute Command (Detached Mode):**\n    *   Run the provided `command` using `run_shell_command` in detached mode (`-d`) if applicable (e.g., `docker-compose up --build -d`). This prevent","body":"# Auto-Debug Command Execution\n\nThis skill automates the process of executing a shell command, monitoring its output for errors, attempting to debug and fix identified issues, and re-running the command until it succeeds.\n\n## Workflow\n\nWhen this skill is activated with a shell command, follow these steps:\n\n1.  **Execute Command (Detached Mode):**\n    *   Run the provided `command` using `run_shell_command` in detached mode (`-d`) if applicable (e.g., `docker-compose up --build -d`). This prevents the command from blocking the agent''s execution.\n    *   If the command is not a long-running process and doesn''t support detached mode, execute it directly and capture its output.\n\n2.  **Monitor and Collect Logs:**\n    *   Immediately after executing the command, use appropriate tools to collect logs. For Docker Compose, this means `docker-compose logs --no-log-prefix`. For other commands, analyze the direct output or relevant log files.\n\n3.  **Analyze Logs for Errors:**\n    *   Scan the collected logs for keywords indicating errors (e.g., `ERROR`, `Failed`, `Exception`, `cannot`, `not found`).\n    *   Identify the most recent or critical error message and its context (e.g., file path, line number, class name).\n\n4.  **Diagnose and Propose Fix (Internal Reasoning):**\n    *   Based on the identified error, diagnose the root cause.\n    *   Formulate a concrete plan to fix the error. This may involve:\n        *   Modifying configuration files (`write_file` or `replace`).\n        *   Renaming files (`run_shell_command mv`).\n        *   Adjusting environment variables.\n        *   Updating `Dockerfile` contents.\n        *   Consulting internal knowledge (e.g., OpenIG configuration patterns).\n    *   **Crucially:** If the fix involves code/config modification, ensure it adheres to project conventions and existing patterns.\n\n5.  **Apply Fix:**\n    *   Execute the necessary tool calls (e.g., `write_file`, `replace`, `run_shell_command`) to apply the proposed fix.\n\n6.  **Clean Up (if necessary):**\n    *   If the command involves Docker containers, always bring them down (`docker-compose down`) before attempting to re-run `docker-compose up --build -d` with a new configuration. This ensures a clean state.\n\n7.  **Loop or Conclude:**\n    *   Go back to **Step 1** (Execute Command) and repeat the cycle until the logs indicate successful completion of the initial command without critical errors.\n    *   If a series of attempts (e.g., 3-5 iterations) fails to resolve the issue, or if the error seems unresolvable given current tools/context, report the unresolvable state and the last error to the user, seeking further guidance.\n\n8.  **Report Success:** Once the command runs successfully and logs show no errors, report success to the user and present any relevant output or next steps (e.g., how to verify the environment).\n\n## Usage\n\nActivate this skill when a shell command needs to be executed with automated error detection and self-correction.\n\nExample: `Use the auto-debug-command skill to run \"docker-compose up --build\"`"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:06.753Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated shell command debugging and execution.","zh":"适合需要自动化shell命令调试和执行的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがシェルコマンドの自動化されたデバッグと実行を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 쉘 명령 디버깅 및 실행이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan depuración y ejecución automática de comandos de shell.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement ayant besoin d''une exécution et d''une débogage de commandes shell automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Shell-Befehls-Debugging und -Ausführung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de depuração e execução automatizada de comandos de shell.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированная отладка и выполнение команд shell.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية التي تحتاج إلى تشخيص وأداء آلي لأوامر Shell."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate shell command execution, monitoring, and debugging using detached mode, providing error detection and correction capabilities with protocols like docker-compose, and file formats like shell scripts.","zh":"赋予代理自动化shell命令执行、监控和调试的能力，使用分离模式，提供错误检测和纠正能力，支持docker-compose等协议和shell脚本等文件格式。","ja":"エージェントにシェルコマンドの実行、監視、デバッグを自動化する能力を付与します。分離モードを使用し、docker-composeなどのプロトコルやシェルスクリプトなどのファイル形式をサポートすることで、エラーの検出と修正機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 분리 모드를 사용하여 쉘 명령의 자동화된 실행, 모니터링 및 디버깅을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다. 도커 컴포즈와 같은 프로토콜 및 쉘 스크립트와 같은 파일 형식을 지원하여 오류 감지 및 수정 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la ejecución de comandos de shell, monitoreo y depuración utilizando el modo desacoplado, proporcionando capacidades de detección y corrección de errores con protocolos como docker-compose y formatos de archivo como scripts de shell.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser l''exécution de commandes shell, la surveillance et la débogage en mode détaché, offrant des capacités de détection et de correction d''erreurs avec des protocoles tels que docker-compose et des formats de fichiers tels que les scripts shell.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, die Ausführung von Shell-Befehlen, Überwachung und Debugging im abgekoppelten Modus zu automatisieren, wobei Fehlererkennungs- und Korrekturfunktionen mit Protokollen wie docker-compose und Dateiformaten wie Shell-Skripten bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a execução de comandos de shell, monitoramento e depuração usando modo desanexado, fornecendo capacidades de detecção e correção de erros com protocolos como docker-compose e formatos de arquivo como scripts de shell.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать выполнение команд shell, мониторинг и отладку с помощью отсоединенного режима, обеспечивая возможности обнаружения и исправления ошибок с протоколами типа docker-compose и форматами файлов типа скриптов shell.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل آلي لأوامر Shell و