swagger.json` file if any API endpoints, request/response schemas, or parameters have cha","body":"# Skill Overview\nThis skill must be invoked after every task is completed. Your primary responsibility is to ensure that the project''s documentation and API specifications are current.\n\n## Instructions\n1. **At the end of every task**, you must:\n   - Review the changes made during the task.\n   - Update all relevant Markdown files in the `docs/` directory to reflect the new state of the code.\n   - Update the `swagger.json` file if any API endpoints, request/response schemas, or parameters have changed.\n2. Ensure that the documentation and the Swagger file remain synchronized with the implementation.\n3. If no changes were made that affect the API or documentation, you may skip the updates but you must still verify that everything is consistent.\n4. Update the `changelog.md` file with the changes made during the task.\n\n---\n> **Important**: This is a mandatory step for the agent to perform before considering a task fully verified and closed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:17.307Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated documentation updates and API specification management.","zh":"适用于需要自动更新文档和 API 规范管理的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが自動的にドキュメントを更新し、API の仕様を管理する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 문서 업데이트와 API 사양 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren actualizaciones de documentación automatizadas y gestión de especificaciones de API.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des mises à jour de documentation automatisées et une gestion des spécifications d''API.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die automatisierte Dokumentenaktualisierungen und API-Spezifikationsmanagement erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem atualizações automatizadas de documentação e gerenciamento de especificações de API.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих ав