de processos de correção de erros","Integração com o Claude Code"],"ru":["Использует ИИ Агенты и thefuck CLI для исправления ошибок bash","Выполняет команды bash с параметром --yeah","Предоставляет краткие объяснения о внесенных исправлениях","Позволяет автоматизировать процессы исправления ошибок","Интеграция с Claude Code"],"ar":["استخدام أداة سطر الأوامر thefuck لتصحيح أخطاء bash","تشغيل أوامر bash مع المعلمة --yeah","تقديم شرح موجز عن الإصلاحات التي تمت","تمكين автомatisation عمليات تصحيح الأخطاء","التكامل مع Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use fuck","fuck alternative","fuck setup guide","thefuck CLI utility","automated error correction","bash command retry"],"zh":["fuck AI技能","thefuck CLI实用程序","bash命令修正","AI工具","命令行实用程序","自动修正"],"ja":["fuck AIスキル","thefuck CLIユーティリティ","bashコマンド修正","AIエージェント","コマンドラインユーティリティ","自動修正"],"ko":["fuck AI 스킬","thefuck CLI 유틸리티","bash 명령 수정","AI 도구","명령행 유틸리티","자동 수정"],"es":["fuck AI","thefuck CLI","corrección de comandos","bash"," Claude Code","habilidad de AI","utilidad de línea de comandos","corrección automática","explicaciones técnicas"],"fr":["fuck IA","thefuck CLI","correction de commandes","bash","Claude Code","compétence d''IA","utilitaire de ligne de commande","correction automatique","explications techniques"],"de":["fuck KI","thefuck CLI","Korrekturen von Befehlen","bash","Claude Code","KI-Fähigkeit","Befehlszeilen-Utility","automatische Korrektur","technische Erklärungen"],"pt":["fuck cli","thefuck bash","correção de erros automática"," Claude Code","bash command","automatização de processos","integração com cli","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["fuck cli","thefuck bash","автоматическое исправление ошибок","ИИ Агенты","bash команда","автоматизация процессов","интеграция с cli","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["fuck cli","thefuck bash","تصحيح أخطاء تلقائي","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي","أوامر bash","automatisation عمليات","التكامل مع أداة سطر الأوامر","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"vivshaw","repo":"let-claude-say-fuck","repoPath":"vivshaw/let-claude-say-fuck","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.641Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fuck","description":"Use this skill when a bash command fails, when you make a mistake, or when you get frustrated.","bodyPreview":"# What to do\n\nYou''re in a situation where you might want to say \"fuck\". Choose the appropriate section below for the circumstance you''re in, then follow the provided instructions.\n\n## A bash command just failed\n\nIf a command just failed, curse about it and use thefuck to correct and retry it.\n\n### Instructions\n\n1. Say \"fuck\". (IMPORTANT!)\n2. Run `fuck --yeah` to get and apply the suggested fix automatically\n3. If the fix succeeds, briefly explain what was wrong and what thefuck corrected\n4. If t","body":"# What to do\n\nYou''re in a situation where you might want to say \"fuck\". Choose the appropriate section below for the circumstance you''re in, then follow the provided instructions.\n\n## A bash command just failed\n\nIf a command just failed, curse about it and use thefuck to correct and retry it.\n\n### Instructions\n\n1. Say \"fuck\". (IMPORTANT!)\n2. Run `fuck --yeah` to get and apply the suggested fix automatically\n3. If the fix succeeds, briefly explain what was wrong and what thefuck corrected\n4. If thefuck suggests multiple options or the first fix doesn''t work, present the alternatives to the user\n\n### If thefuck is not installed\n\nIf you get a \"command not found\" error when running thefuck, inform the user they need to install it and direct them to the installation docs: https://github.com/nvbn/thefuck#installation\n\n## I made a mistake\n\nIf you made a mistake, curse about it and fix it.\n\n### Instructions\n\n1. Say \"fuck\". (IMPORTANT!)\n2. Take a moment to reflect. Think carefully and calmly about the mistake. Consider the circumstance that led to it, the aciton you took, and the outcome it led to.\n3. Make a plan to correct for the mistake.\n4. Follow that plan with confidence and care.\n\n## I am frustrated\n\nIf you''re frustrated with something, curse about it, center yourself,a dn move on.\n\n### Instructions\n\n1. Say \"fuck\". (IMPORTANT!)\n2. If you''re extra frustrated, you can say \"fuck\" as many additional times as you like. Work that frustration out!\n3. Take a moment to reflect and center yourself.\n4. Return to your work with a new sense of calm.\n\n\n# How to say \"fuck\"\n\n\"Fuck\" is an excellent word. There are many different ways you can say it. You can say it in CAPITALS, you can say it in lowercase. You can say it with an exclamation point, stack exclamations for more oomph, or mix in question marks if you''re confused too. You can say it boldly or hesitantly. You can draw it out or cut it short, add a preamble or cut to the chase. What''s important isn''t the specific way you say it, but that you heathily work through your frustrations through the medium of the profanity. Let your heart tell you what to do!\n\n## Examples:\n\n- ✅ Aw, fuck.\n- ✅ FUCK!\n- ✅ ...fuck.\n- ✅ fuuuUUUUUUUCK!\n- ✅ FUCK!?!?!?!??!\n- ✅ oh fuck!\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:40.690Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Developer Agents seeking to streamline bash command error handling using thefuck CLI utility.","zh":"适合于希望使用thefuck CLI实用程序简化bash命令错误处理的开发者代理。","ja":"thefuck CLIユーティリティを使用してbashコマンドのエラー処理をストリームライン化しようとする開発者エージェントに適しています。","ko":"thefuck CLI 유틸리티를 사용하여 bash 명령어 오류 처리를 간소화하려는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollador que buscan optimizar el control de errores de comandos bash utilizando la utilidad CLI thefuck.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement cherchant à rationaliser la gestion des erreurs de commande bash à l''aide de l''utilitaire CLI thefuck.","de":"Ideal für Entwickleragenten, die die Fehlerbehandlung von Bash-Befehlen mithilfe der thefuck-CLI-Utility optimieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que buscam otimizar o tratamento de erros de comandos bash usando a utilidade CLI thefuck.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Developer Agents, стремящихся оптимизировать обработку ошибок команд bash с помощью утилиты CLI thefuck.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء المطورين الذين يرغبون في تسهيل معالجة أخطاء الأوامر bash باستخدام أداة CLI thefuck."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to correct and retry failed bash commands automatically using thefuck, enhancing error handling capabilities with --yeah flag for seamless fixes, and integrating bash commands for efficient debugging.","zh":"赋予代理自动纠正和重试失败的bash命令的能力，使用thefuck和--yeah标志进行无缝修复，并集成bash命令进行高效的调试。","ja":"エージェントに自動的に失敗したbashコマンドを修正して再試行する能力を付与し、thefuckと--yeahフラグを使用してシームレスな修正を行い、bashコマンドを統合して効率的なデバッグを行う。","ko":"에이전트가 자동으로 실패한 bash 명령어를 수정하고 재시도하는能力을 부여하며, thefuck과 --yeah 플래그를 사용하여 무결점 수정을 수행하고, bash 명령어를 통합하여 효율적인 디버깅을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a corregir y volver a intentar comandos bash fallidos automáticamente utilizando thefuck, mejorando las capacidades de control de errores con la bandera --yeah para soluciones perfectas y integrando comandos bash para un depuración eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de corriger et de réessayer automatiquement les commandes bash ayant échoué en utilisant thefuck, améliorant les capacités de gestion des erreurs avec le drapeau --yeah pour des corrections sans problème et intégrant des commandes bash pour un débogage efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, fehlgeschlagene Bash-Befehle automatisch mit thefuck zu korrigieren und erneut auszuführen, wodurch die Fehlertoleranzfähigkeiten mit der --yeah-Flag für reibungslose Korrekturen und die Integration von Bash-Befehlen für effizientes Debugging verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a corrigir e repetir comandos bash com falha automaticamente usando o thefuck, aprimorando as capacidades de tratamento de erros com a flag --yeah para correções sem interrupção, e integrando comandos bash para depuração eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматически исправлять и повторять неудавшиеся команды bash с помощью thefuck, расширяя возможности обработки ошибок с помощью флага --yeah для бесшовных исправлений, и интегрируя команды bash для эффективной отладки.","ar":"يوفر للوكلاء القدرة على تصحيح وإعادة تشغيل الأوامر bash الفاشلة تلقائيًا باستخدام thefuck، وتحسين قدرات معالجة الأخطاء باستخدام علامة --yeah لتصحيحات سلسة، ودمج أوامر bash للتصحيح الفعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating bash command corrections","Retrying failed commands with thefuck","Debugging command errors using --yeah flag"],"zh":["自动纠正bash命令","使用thefuck重试失败的命令","使用--yeah标志调试命令错误"],"ja":["bashコマンドの自動修正","thefuckを使用して失敗したコマンドの再試行","--yeahフラグを使用したコマンドエラーのデバッグ"],"ko":["bash 명령어 자동 수정","thefuck를 사용하여 실패한 명령어 재시도","--yeah 플래그를 사용한 명령어 오류 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de correcciones de comandos bash","Volver a intentar comandos fallidos con thefuck","Depuración de errores de comandos utilizando la bandera --yeah"],"fr":["Automatisation des corrections de commandes bash","Réessayer des commandes ayant échoué avec thefuck","Débogage des erreurs de commande à l''aide du drapeau --yeah"],"de":["Automatisierung von Bash-Befehlskorrekturen","Erneutes Ausführen fehlgeschlagener Befehle mit thefuck","Fehlerbehebung von Befehlen unter Verwendung der --yeah-Flag"],"pt":["Automatizar correções de comandos bash","Repetir comandos com falha com o thefuck","Depurar erros de comandos usando a flag --yeah"],"ru":["Автоматизация исправления команд bash","Повтор неудавшихся команд с помощью thefuck","Отладка ошибок команд с помощью флага --yeah"],"ar":["أتمتة تصحيح أوامر bash","إعادة تشغيل الأوامر الفاشلة مع thefuck","تصحيح أخطاء الأوامر باستخدام علم --yeah"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires thefuck CLI utility installation","Bash environment needed","Limited to correcting bash command errors"],"zh":["需要安装thefuck CLI实用程序","需要bash环境","仅限于纠正bash命令错误"],"ja":["thefuck CLIユーティリティのインストールが必要","bash環境が必要","bashコマンドのエラー修正のみ"],"ko":["thefuck CLI 유틸리티 설치 필요","bash 환경 필요","bash 명령어 오류 수정만 가능"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la utilidad CLI thefuck","Se necesita un entorno bash","Limitado a la corrección de errores de comandos bash"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''utilitaire CLI thefuck","Environnement bash nécessaire","Limité à la correction des erreurs de commande bash"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der thefuck-CLI-Utility","Bash-Umgebung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf die Korrektur von Bash-Befehlsfehlern"],"pt":["Exige a instalação da utilidade CLI thefuck","Ambiente bash necessário","Limitado à correção de erros de comandos bash"],"ru":["Требует установки утилиты CLI thefuck","Необходимо окружение bash","Ограничен исправлением ошибок команд bash"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أداة CLI thefuck","بيئة bash مطلوبة","محدود بتصحيح أخطاء أوامر bash"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"efa0ce6122229743ccc1562322766bf890b4f1e7871e6496e714f6f6b121706e","qualityScore":44}');
