持","Intel 支持"],"ja":["ACE-Step ドキュメント","ローカル音楽生成モデル","設定ガイド","音楽生成ツール","AI 音楽生成","CUDA サポート","Mac サポート","AMD サポート","Intel サポート","AIエージェント"],"ko":["ACE-Step 문서","로컬 음악 생성 모델","설정 가이드","음악 생성 도구","AI 음악 생성","CUDA 지원","Mac 지원","AMD 지원","Intel 지원","AI 에이전트"],"es":["ACE-Step Docs","modelo de generación de música local","CUDA","desarrollo de música","guía de configuración","mejores prácticas para desarrolladores","modelo de música de alta calidad","Herramientas de AI para música","Agentes de IA para música"],"fr":["ACE-Step Docs","modèle de génération de musique local","CUDA","développement de musique","guide d''installation","meilleures pratiques pour les développeurs","modèle de musique de haute qualité","Outils d''IA pour la musique","Agents d''IA pour la musique"],"de":["ACE-Step Docs","lokales Musikgenerierungsmodell","CUDA","Musikentwicklung","Einrichtungsanleitung","Best Practices für Entwickler","Musikmodell von hoher Qualität","AI-Tools für Musik","KI-Agents für Musik"],"pt":["acestep-docs","modelo de geração de música local","suporte a dispositivos Mac","suporte a dispositivos AMD","suporte a dispositivos Intel","suporte a dispositivos CUDA","documentação de configuração","guias de uso"],"ru":["acestep-docs","мощный местный модель генерации музыки","поддержка устройств Mac","поддержка устройств AMD","поддержка устройств Intel","поддержка устройств CUDA","документация по настройке","руководства по использованию","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["acestep-docs","نظام توليد موسيقى محلي","دعم لأجهزة ماك","دعم لأجهزة AMD","دعم لأجهزة Intel","دعم لأجهزة CUDA","وثائق إعداد","إرشادات استخدام"]}},"owner":"ace-step","repo":"ACE-Step-1.5","repoPath":"ace-step/ACE-Step-1.5","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T12:46:33.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"acestep-docs","description":"ACE-Step documentation and troubleshooting. Use when users ask about installing ACE-Step, GPU configuration, model download, Gradio UI usage, API integration, or troubleshooting issues like VRAM problems, CUDA errors, or model loading failures.","bodyPreview":"# ACE-Step Documentation\n\nDocumentation skill for ACE-Step music generation system.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Getting Started\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [README.md](getting-started/README.md) | Installation, model download, startup commands |\n| [Tutorial.md](getting-started/Tutorial.md) | Getting started tutorial, best practices |\n| [ABOUT.md](getting-started/ABOUT.md) | Project overview, architecture, model zoo |\n\n### Guides\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|---","body":"# ACE-Step Documentation\n\nDocumentation skill for ACE-Step music generation system.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Getting Started\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [README.md](getting-started/README.md) | Installation, model download, startup commands |\n| [Tutorial.md](getting-started/Tutorial.md) | Getting started tutorial, best practices |\n| [ABOUT.md](getting-started/ABOUT.md) | Project overview, architecture, model zoo |\n\n### Guides\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [GRADIO_GUIDE.md](guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md) | Web UI usage guide |\n| [INFERENCE.md](guides/INFERENCE.md) | Inference parameters tuning |\n| [GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md](guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md) | GPU/VRAM configuration, hardware recommendations |\n| [ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md](guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md) | Environment detection, uv installation, python_embeded setup (Windows/Linux/macOS) |\n| [SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md](guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md) | Configuring launch scripts: .bat (Windows) and .sh (Linux/macOS) |\n| [UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md](guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md) | Git updates, file backup, conflict resolution (all platforms) |\n\n### API (for developers)\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [API.md](api/API.md) | REST API documentation |\n| [Openrouter_API.md](api/Openrouter_API.md) | OpenRouter API integration |\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Installation questions → read [getting-started/README.md](getting-started/README.md)\n2. General usage / best practices → read [getting-started/Tutorial.md](getting-started/Tutorial.md)\n3. Project overview / architecture → read [getting-started/ABOUT.md](getting-started/ABOUT.md)\n4. Web UI questions → read [guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md](guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md)\n5. Inference parameter tuning → read [guides/INFERENCE.md](guides/INFERENCE.md)\n6. GPU/VRAM issues → read [guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md](guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md)\n7. Environment setup (uv, python_embeded) → read [guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md](guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md)\n8. Launch script configuration (.bat/.sh) → read [guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md](guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md)\n9. Updates and backup → read [guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md](guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md)\n10. API development → read [api/API.md](api/API.md) or [api/Openrouter_API.md](api/Openrouter_API.md)\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Installation problems**: See getting-started/README.md\n- **VRAM insufficient**: See guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md\n- **Model download failed**: See getting-started/README.md or guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md\n- **uv not found**: See guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md\n- **Environment detection issues**: See guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md\n- **BAT/SH script configuration**: See guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md\n- **Update and backup**: See guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md\n- **Update conflicts**: See guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md\n- **Inference quality issues**: See guides/INFERENCE.md\n- **Gradio UI not starting**: See guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T12:52:26.600Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Music Generation Agents needing comprehensive documentation and local model support for Mac, AMD, Intel, and CUDA devices.","zh":"非常适合需要全面文档和本地模型支持的Mac、AMD、Intel和CUDA设备的音乐生成代理。","ja":"Mac、AMD、Intel、CUDAデバイスの包括的なドキュメントとローカルモデルサポートを必要とする音楽生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Mac, AMD, Intel 및 CUDA 디바이스에 대한 포괄적인 문서 및 로컬 모델 지원이 필요한 음악 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de música que necesitan documentación completa y soporte de modelo local para Mac, AMD, Intel y dispositivos CUDA.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de musique ayant besoin d''une documentation complète et d''un support de modèle local pour Mac, AMD, Intel et appareils CUDA.","de":"Perfekt für Musik-Generierungs-Agents, die umfassende Dokumentation und lokale Modellunterstützung für Mac, AMD, Intel und CUDA-Geräte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Música que necessitam de documentação abrangente e suporte de modelo local para dispositivos Mac, AMD, Intel e CUDA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации музыки, которым необходима всесторонняя документация и поддержка локальных моделей для устройств Mac, AMD, Intel и CUDA.","ar":"مثالي لعميل توليد الموسيقى الذي يحتاج إلى توثيق شامل ودعم نموذج محلي لأجهزة Mac و AMD و Intel و CUDA."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage the ACE-Step music generation system with detailed guides, tutorials, and model overviews, utilizing README.md, Tutorial.md, and ABOUT.md files for seamless integration and development, supporting various device architectures.","zh":"赋予代理使用ACE-Step音乐生成系统的详细指南、教程和模型概述，利用README.md、Tutorial.md和ABOUT.md文件实现无缝集成和开发，支持各种设备架构。","ja":"ACE-Step音楽生成システムを使用するための詳細なガイド、チュートリアル、モデル概要を提供し、README.md、Tutorial.md、ABOUT.mdファイルを使用してシームレスな統合と開発を実現し、さまざまなデバイスアーキテクチャをサポートします。","ko":"ACE-Step 음악 생성 시스템을 사용하기 위한詳細한 가이드, 튜토리얼 및 모델 개요를 제공하며, README.md, Tutorial.md 및 ABOUT.md 파일을 사용하여无缝한 통합 및 개발을 지원하며, 다양한 디바이스 아키텍처를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar el sistema de generación de música ACE-Step con guías detalladas, tutoriales y descripciones generales de los modelos, utilizando archivos README.md, Tutorial.md y ABOUT.md para una integración y desarrollo sin problemas, y soportando diversas arquitecturas de dispositivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter le système de génération de musique ACE-Step avec des guides détaillés, des didacticiels et des descriptions générales de modèles, en utilisant des fichiers README.md, Tutorial.md et ABOUT.md pour une intégration et un développement sans problème, et en prenant en charge diverses architectures d''appareils.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, das Musik-Generierungs-System ACE-Step mit detaillierten Anleitungen, Tutorials und Modellübersichten zu nutzen, indem sie README.md-, Tutorial.md- und ABOUT.md-Dateien für eine nahtlose Integration und Entwicklung verwenden und verschiedene Gerätearchitekturen unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o sistema de geração de música ACE-Step com guias detalhadas, tutoriais e visões gerais de modelos, utilizando arquivos README.md, Tutorial.md e ABOUT.md para integração e desenvolvimento sem problemas, suportando várias arquiteturas de dispositivos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать систему генерации музыки ACE-Step с подробными руководствами, учебниками и обзорами моделей, используя файлы README.md, Tutorial.md и ABOUT.md для бесшовной интеграции и разработки, поддерживая различные архитектуры устройств.","ar":"تمكين العميل من استخدام نظام توليد الموسيقى ACE-Step مع دلائل مفصلة وبرامج تعليمية وملخصات نموذجية، باستخدام ملفات README.md و Tutorial.md و ABOUT.md من أجل التكامل والتطوير السلس، مع دعم لمعمارية الأجهزة المختلفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating music with local model support","Debugging ACE-Step system installations","Creating custom music generation tutorials"],"zh":["使用本地模型支持生成音乐","调试ACE-Step系统安装","创建自定义音乐生成教程"],"ja":["ローカルモデルサポートを使用して音楽を生成する","ACE-Stepシステムのインストールをデバッグする","カスタム音楽生成チュートリアルを作成する"],"ko":["로컬 모델 지원을 사용하여 음악을 생성하는こと","ACE-Step 시스템 설치를 디버깅하는 것","사용자 지정 음악 생성 튜토리얼を作成하는 것"],"es":["Generar música con soporte de modelo local","Depurar instalaciones del sistema ACE-Step","Crear tutoriales de generación de música personalizados"],"fr":["Générer de la musique avec un support de modèle local","Déboguer les installations du système ACE-Step","Créer des didacticiels de génération de musique personnalisés"],"de":["Musik mit lokaler Modellunterstützung generieren","ACE-Step-Systeminstallationen debuggen","Benutzerdefinierte Musik-Generierungs-Tutorials erstellen"],"pt":["Geração de música com suporte de modelo local","Depuração de instalações do sistema ACE-Step","Criação de tutoriais personalizados de geração de música"],"ru":["Генерация музыки с поддержкой локальных моделей","Отладка установки системы ACE-Step","Создание пользовательских учебников по генерации музыки"],"ar":["توليد الموسيقى مع دعم نموذج محلي","تصحيح أخطاء تثبيت نظام ACE-Step","إنشاء دروس تعليمية مخصصة لتوليد الموسيقى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires local device support for Mac, AMD, Intel, or CUDA","Specific to ACE-Step music generation system"],"zh":["需要Mac、AMD、Intel或CUDA的本地设备支持","特定于ACE-Step音乐生成系统"],"ja":["Mac、AMD、Intel、またはCUDAのローカルデバイスサポートが必要","ACE-Step音楽生成システムに特有"],"ko":["Mac, AMD, Intel 또는 CUDA의 로컬 디바이스 지원이 필요함","ACE-Step 음악 생성 시스템에 특정"],"es":["Requiere soporte de dispositivo local para Mac, AMD, Intel o CUDA","Específico del sistema de generación de música ACE-Step"],"fr":["Nécessite un support d''appareil local pour Mac, AMD, Intel ou CUDA","Spécifique au système de génération de musique ACE-Step"],"de":["Benötigt lokale Geräteunterstützung für Mac, AMD, Intel oder CUDA","Spezifisch für das Musik-Generierungs-System ACE-Step"],"pt":["Requer suporte de dispositivo local para Mac, AMD, Intel ou CUDA","Específico para o sistema de geração de música ACE-Step"],"ru":["Требует поддержки локального устройства для Mac, AMD, Intel или CUDA","Относится к системе генерации музыки ACE-Step"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم جهاز محلي لأجهزة Mac و AMD و Intel و CUDA","محدد لنظام توليد الموسيقى ACE-Step"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"32f02c5a183ae7026c1e3adc85604589d2b1430ebd799d554fb07be9dc0f3356","qualityScore":44}');
