tas IA para video","cómo usar video.js v10","video.js vs hls.js","instalar video.js react","optimización video con IA","framework reproductor open source","video.js setup guide","alternativas video.js"],"fr":["video.js v10 aperçu","lecteur multimédia react","outils IA pour vidéo","comment utiliser video.js v10","video.js vs hls.js","installer video.js react","optimisation vidéo avec IA","framework lecteur open source","guide configuration video.js","alternatives video.js"],"de":["video.js v10 vorschau","medienplayer react","ki-tools für video","wie verwendet man video.js v10","video.js vs hls.js","video.js react installieren","videooptimierung mit ki","open source player framework","video.js einrichtungsanleitung","video.js alternativen"],"pt":["como usar Video.js","o que é Video.js","Video.js vs outros frameworks","instalar Video.js","guia de configuração do Video.js","alternativas ao Video.js","Video.js para desenvolvedores","framework de mídia para Web e React"],"ru":["как использовать Video.js","что такое Video.js","Video.js vs другие фреймворки","установить Video.js","руководство по настройке Video.js","альтернативы Video.js","Video.js для разработчиков","фреймворк медиа для Web и React"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Video.js","ما هو Video.js","Video.js مقابل إطارات عمل أخرى","تثبيت Video.js","دليل إعداد Video.js","بديل ل Video.js","Video.js للمطورين","إطار الوسائط للويب و React"]}},"owner":"videojs","repo":"v10","repoPath":"videojs/v10","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T01:51:08.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# API Design & Developer Experience\n\nPrinciples for designing TypeScript library APIs and evaluating developer experience.\n\n**Goal**: APIs should feel **obvious**, **fast**, **safe**, and **composable** — with great defaults and great escape hatches.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Foundational\n\n- **Emergent extensibility** — Best extension points look like well-designed APIs, not plugin systems\n- **Composition over configuration** — `devtools(persist(fn))` beats `{ middlewares: [] }`\n- **Onion model**","body":"# API Design & Developer Experience\n\nPrinciples for designing TypeScript library APIs and evaluating developer experience.\n\n**Goal**: APIs should feel **obvious**, **fast**, **safe**, and **composable** — with great defaults and great escape hatches.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Foundational\n\n- **Emergent extensibility** — Best extension points look like well-designed APIs, not plugin systems\n- **Composition over configuration** — `devtools(persist(fn))` beats `{ middlewares: [] }`\n- **Onion model** — Transformative middleware innermost, observational outermost\n\n### API Surface\n\n- **Config objects** for 3+ parameters (no overloads)\n- **Flat returns** for independent values, namespaced for cohesive units\n- **Rule of two** — Tuples for 2 values, objects for 3+\n- **Inference over annotation** — If users annotate, types aren''t flowing\n\n### Progressive Disclosure\n\n- **Complexity grows with use case** — Zero-config → Options → Composition → Headless → Core\n- **Escape hatches compose** — Don''t require reimplementing defaults\n- **Explicit contracts** — Render props over implicit requirements\n\n### Developer Experience\n\n- **Time-to-first-success** — Minimize time from install to working code\n- **Cognitive load** — Fewer concepts > fewer keystrokes\n- **Predictable outcomes** — Match user mental models\n- **Editor ergonomics** — TypeScript inference should just work\n\n### Conflict Resolution\n\nWhen principles conflict, prioritize:\n\n1. **Correctness** — wrong behavior > verbose API\n2. **Type Safety** — inference failures > extra generics\n3. **Simplicity** — fewer concepts > fewer keystrokes\n4. **Consistency** — match existing codebase patterns\n5. **Bundle Size** — tree-shaking matters, but not at DX cost\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern                | Why It Fails                            |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| Function overloads          | Poor errors, autocomplete confusion     |\n| Runtime plugin registration | Loses type safety, implicit ordering    |\n| Positional parameters (3+)  | Order confusion, breaking changes       |\n| Implicit contracts          | Silent breakage when requirements unmet |\n| Per-module middleware       | Unexpected interactions                 |\n| Shotgun parsing             | Validation scattered, not at boundaries |\n| Boolean traps               | `fn(true, false)` — what do these mean? |\n| Multiple competing APIs     | Confusing — which method to use?        |\n\n## Reference Files\n\n| File                                                       | Contents                                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| [references/principles.md](references/principles.md)       | Core design and DX principles               |\n| [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)       | Type inference patterns (author + consumer) |\n| [references/state.md](references/state.md)                 | State management patterns and architecture  |\n| [references/extensibility.md](references/extensibility.md) | Pipelines, builders, adapters, lifecycles   |\n| [references/anti-patterns.md](references/anti-patterns.md) | Common mistakes to avoid                    |\n| [references/libraries.md](references/libraries.md)         | Reference libraries and their patterns      |\n| [references/voices.md](references/voices.md)               | Practitioner heuristics and reference URLs  |\n\n## Loading by Domain\n\n| Domain              | Load                        |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| General API work    | `principles.md`             |\n| TypeScript/types    | `typescript.md`             |\n| State management    | `state.md`                  |\n| Middleware/plugins  | `extensibility.md`          |\n| Avoiding mistakes   | `anti-patterns.md`          |\n| Library comparisons | `libraries.md`, `voices.md` |\n\n## Review\n\nFor reviewing APIs and architecture, load `review/workflow.md`.\n\n| File                                       | Contents                      |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| [review/workflow.md](review/workflow.md)   | Review process and checklists |\n| [review/agents.md](review/agents.md)       | Sub-agent prompts             |\n| [review/templates.md](review/templates.md) | Issue format, report template |\n| [review/checklist.md](review/checklist.md) | Quick single-agent checklist  |\n| [review/example.md](review/example.md)     | Complete example review       |\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| Need                   | Use               |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------- |\n| Building UI components | `component` skill |\n| Accessibility patterns | `aria` skill      |\n| Documentation          | `docs` skill |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T02:04:58.252Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing to design and evaluate TypeScript library APIs with great defaults and escape hatches.","zh":"非常适合需要设计和评估TypeScript库API的开发者代理，提供了很好的默认值和逃生舱口。","ja":"TypeScriptライブラリAPIを設計および評価する必要がある開発者エージェントに最適です。デフォルト値とエスケープハッチが優れています。","ko":"TypeScript 라이브러리 API를 설계 및 평가해야 하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 좋은 기본값과 탈출구를 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan diseñar y evaluar APIs de bibliotecas de TypeScript con configuraciones predeterminadas excelentes y escapes de emergencia.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin de concevoir et d''évaluer les APIs de bibliothèques TypeScript avec de bonnes configurations par défaut et des échappatoires.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die TypeScript-Bibliotheks-APIs mit großartigen Standardwerten und Notfallausgängen entwerfen und bewerten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que precisam projetar e avaliar bibliotecas de API do TypeScript com ótimos padrões e escotilhas de fuga.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-разработчиков, которым нужно проектировать и оценивать библиотеки API TypeScript с отличными настройками по умолчанию и возможностью обхода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذي يحتاج إلى تصميم وتقييم مكتبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات TypeScript مع إعدادات افتراضية رائعة وطرق للخروج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create obvious, fast, safe, and composable APIs using principles like emergent extensibility, composition over configuration, and the onion model, with support for advanced TypeScript features.","zh":"赋予代理创建明显、快速、安全和可组合的API的能力，使用诸如出现的可扩展性、组合优于配置和洋葱模型等原则，并支持高级TypeScript功能。","ja":"エージェントが明確で迅速で安全で構成可能なAPIを作成する能力を与え、発生的な拡張性、構成よりも構成、オニオンモデルなどの原則を使用し、先進的なTypeScript機能をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 명확하고 빠르고 안전하고 구성 가능한 API를 만들 수 있는 능력을 부여하며,出现的 확장성, 구성보다 구성, 양파 모델などの 원칙을 사용하고 고급 TypeScript 기능을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear APIs obvias, rápidas, seguras y componibles utilizando principios como la extensibilidad emergente, la composición sobre configuración y el modelo de cebolla, con soporte para características avanzadas de TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des APIs évidentes, rapides, sûres et componibles en utilisant des principes tels que l''extensibilité émergente, la composition sur configuration et le modèle oignon, avec une prise en charge des fonctionnalités avancées de TypeScript.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, offensichtliche, schnelle, sichere und komponierbare APIs unter Verwendung von Prinzipien wie emergierender Erweiterbarkeit, Komposition über Konfiguration und Zwiebelschalenmodell mit Unterstützung für erweiterte TypeScript-Funktionen zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar APIs óbvias, rápidas, seguras e compostas usando princípios como extensibilidade emergente, composição sobre configuração e o modelo de cebola, com suporte a recursos avançados do TypeScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать очевидные, быстрые, безопасные и составные API, используя принципы, такие как эмерджентная расширяемость, композиция над конфигурацией и модель лука, с поддержкой расширенных функций TypeScript.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات واضحة وسريعة وأمنة وقابلة للتكوين باستخدام مبادئ مثل التمدد الناشئ والتركيب على التكوين ونموذج البصل، مع دعم للميزات المتقدمة من TypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing intuitive API interfaces","Evaluating developer experience for TypeScript libraries","Implementing composition over configuration for React applications"],"zh":["设计直观的API接口","评估TypeScript库的开发者体验","为React应用程序实现组合优于配置"],"ja":["直感的なAPIインターフェイスを設計する","TypeScriptライブラリの開発者エクスペリエンスを評価する","Reactアプリケーションで構成よりも構成を実装する"],"ko":["직관적인 API 인터페이스를 설계한다","TypeScript 라이브러리의 개발자 경험을 평가한다","React 애플리케이션에서 구성보다 구성하기를 구현한다"],"es":["Diseñar interfaces de API intuitivas","Evaluar la experiencia del desarrollador para bibliotecas de TypeScript","Implementar la composición sobre configuración para aplicaciones de React"],"fr":["Concevoir des interfaces API intuitives","Évaluer l''expérience du développeur pour les bibliothèques TypeScript","Mettre en œuvre la composition sur configuration pour les applications React"],"de":["Intuitive API-Schnittstellen entwerfen","Die Erfahrung der Entwickler für TypeScript-Bibliotheken bewerten","Komposition über Konfiguration für React-Anwendungen implementieren"],"pt":["Projeto de interfaces de API intuitivas","Avaliação da experiência do desenvolvedor para bibliotecas do TypeScript","Implementação da composição sobre a configuração para aplicativos React"],"ru":["Проектирование интуитивных интерфейсов API","Оценка опыта разработчика для библиотек TypeScript","Реализация композиции над конфигурацией для приложений React"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة","تقييم تجربة المطور لمكتبات TypeScript","تنفيذ التكوين على التكوين لتطبيقات React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of TypeScript and API design principles","Limited to open-source media player frameworks like Video.js"],"zh":["需要了解TypeScript和API设计原则","仅限于开源媒体播放器框架，如Video.js"],"ja":["TypeScriptとAPI設計原則を理解する必要がある","オープンソースメディアプレーヤーフレームワーク（例：Video.js）に限定される"],"ko":["TypeScript와 API 설계 원칙을 이해해야 함","오픈 소스 미디어 플레이어 프레임워크(예: Video.js)로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de TypeScript y principios de diseño de API","Limitado a frameworks de reproductores de medios de código abierto como Video.js"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de TypeScript et des principes de conception d''API","Limité aux frameworks de lecteurs multimédias open source comme Video.js"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis von TypeScript und API-Designprinzipien","Begrenzt auf Open-Source-Mediaplayer-Frameworks wie Video.js"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do TypeScript e dos princípios de design de API","Limitado a frameworks de player de mídia de código aberto como o Video.js"],"ru":["Требует понимания TypeScript и принципов проектирования API","Ограничен фреймворками открытыми медиаплеерами, такими как Video.js"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لغة TypeScript ومبادئ تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","محدود بإطارات اللاعبين الإعلامية مفتوحة المصدر مثل Video.js"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"296fd0941fe75277631b8ac132a7dac0a6efd4af19ed4a0c258b94e9ef5695a5","qualityScore":44}');
